1606001853199411128,Mountain Cave | Pyramids View & Jacuzzi,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1606001853199411128?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-11&check_out=2026-05-16,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1606001853199411128/original/3cc08ef5-3418-4e55-b4bd-373f1ba18409.jpeg,29.97909,31.14692,4.92,12.0,5.0,4.75,4.58,4.75,593,593,0,"A designer retreat where ancient soul meets modern luxury. This hand-sculpted cave offers a meditative atmosphere with one legendary focus: The Great Pyramids. Relax in your integrated Jacuzzi and watch the sunset over the last remaining Ancient Wonder of the World. ✨The spaceThis space is ""habitable art."" We’ve replaced standard walls with hand-textured, organic curves to create a cool, quiet, and cave-like environment. The ""Cave"" is fully equipped with:Sleep: A premium Queen-sized bed (160 x 200 cm)  tucked into a cozy stone alcove for the ultimate deep rest.Wellness: Private integrated Jacuzzi with a direct Pyramid view. Kitchenette: Everything you need—Mini-fridge, Microwave, Electric Cooktop, Kettle, and Sink. Beauty & Care: A dedicated stone vanity with a backlit mirror and a hair dryer provided.✨Entertainment: Smart TV recessed into the cave wall + high-speed Wi-Fi. Climate & Storage: Powerful AC for a crisp ""cave-cool"" feel and a built-in wardrobe for your belongings. Every detail is built into the architecture, keeping the focus entirely on the design and that incredible view.Guest accessThe entire ""Mountain Cave"" is yours. You have 100% private access to the studio, the integrated Jacuzzi, the kitchenette, and the bathroom. Your privacy is our priority.Other things to noteThe View: Unobstructed views of the Pyramids directly from your window and Jacuzzi. The Neighborhood: We are in a real, bustling local community. Expect the ""unfiltered"" energy of Giza—local markets and the call to prayer.The Building: While the suite is a high-end designer escape, it is located inside a traditional, local residential building.",True,249,True,True,True,"""The main view""",other
