1484714498056100115,Vibrant & Bright Rooftop Apartment w/Outdoors Tub,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1484714498056100115?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-18&check_out=2026-05-23,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1484714498056100115/original/29dd40ca-ebb3-42d9-821b-08215996efcc.jpeg,29.96119,31.26367,5.0,41.0,5.0,5.0,4.95,4.98,755,755,0,"Vibrant and unforgettable, The Zarifa is a mood. Take in the impressions of a day of sightseeing while soaking up the golden hour sun in a clawfoot tub overlooking the lush skyline of Cairo's Maadi neighborhood.This flamboyant two-bedroom rooftop apartment sleeps 4, and features a kitchen andbathroom, as well as plenty of indoors as and outdoors lounging & dining spaces. Skillfully designed around bespoke, antique, and vintage materials & furniture, it makes for an authentically Cairene stay.The spaceThis exceptional apartment sleeps 4 people divided on 2 beds in two separate bedrooms.The master bedroom features a king size bed, a smart desk space, a spacious closet, additional seating, and a door to the outdoors bathtub. The smaller secondary bedroom features an antique brass double bed and a dresser.The open kitchen in the living room space is fully equipped for your cooking needs, with a cozy dining area that has seats for four guests, as well as a sitting area with a sofa and tv, hidden in a cabinet on the wall.The balcony is big, with both covered and sunny uncovered sitting areas, including a full-size dining table, and a food-preparation area with a sink, should you want to eat al fresco during your stay. There's also a romantic clawfood tub on the other side of the balcony, shielded from the rest of the balcony by the secondary bedroom, constructed from beautiful antique wooden panels.The apartment itself is strictly non-smoking, but smoking is welcome on the balcony.Guest accessAll parts of the apartment, including the big balcony, is accessible to guests only.Other things to noteThe apartment is located on the 4th floor without an elevator, so the apartment is suitable only for guests who are able to climb stairs.",True,286,False,False,False,,nan
