ot provided or if the booking details do not comply with these terms, we may, unfortunately, be forced to cancel the booking before or upon arrival and vacate the unit immediately without any refund, and we will notify the relevant authorities in accordance with the applicable regulations.We appreciate your understanding and cooperation, and we look forward to hosting you and providing you with a comfortable stay.",True,314,False,True,False,The Pyramids,nan
