1448388580371987584,Rooftop with private jacuzzi in Sodic New Cairo,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1448388580371987584?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-07&check_out=2026-05-12,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTQ0ODM4ODU4MDM3MTk4NzU4NA==/original/f6b602c0-f93c-4db3-ad93-9d6bc0668e42.jpeg,30.023479068690857,31.548121378977804,5.0,43.0,4.95,4.95,4.86,4.91,623,623,0,"Escape to Sunset Soirée, a private rooftop studio in exclusive Sodic Villette. This sky-high sanctuary is perfect for couples or solo travelers seeking peaceful luxury. Unwind in your private jacuzzi with stunning skyline views from the spacious terrace. A truly unforgettable retreat designed for serenity and comfort.The spaceWelcome to your sky-high sanctuary in the heart of Sodic Villette, where modern design meets open-sky serenity. This private rooftop studio is thoughtfully curated for those who crave peaceful luxury and unforgettable moments.The main event is your exclusive rooftop terrace, featuring: A private hot tub with a stunning skyline view. A comfortable daybed to watch the sunset steal the moment. A dining set and BBQ area, perfect for an evening meal under the stars.Inside, you'll find a stylish and comfortable retreat that includes: A chic bedroom area for a restful night's sleep. A dedicated workspace for catching up on emails. A modern bathroom with a relaxing tub.A compact kitchenette, complete with a Nespresso coffee maker to start your day right.Guest accessYou will have exclusive access to the entire studio apartment and your private rooftop terrace. For your convenience, the property offers easy self check-in, and the building is equipped with an elevator.You are also welcome to enjoy the shared community amenities, including a large lap pool and a basketball court, perfect for an active afternoon.Other things to notePlease note that while your apartment and rooftop terrace (including the hot tub) are completely private for your exclusive use, the swimming pool and basketball court are shared community amenities.",True,254,False,True,False,nile,nan
