rical appliances, and villa doors —All from your phone with one click.🔒 Integrated security system- Advanced anti-theft system- Surveillance cameras- Motion sensors- A smart gate connected to the system☀ Advanced Energy Solutions- Integrated solar power station to provide electricity with the highest efficiency- Central air conditioning Cover Energy Efficient- Central Heating System powered by solar and gas- Exceptional car space- A huge garage that can accommodate 5 cars- Built-in car wash system- Perfect storage space- Heavy-duty flooring💧 Health and purity- 4-stage water purification plant to ensure clean and safe water all the timeOther things to note🛎️ Services available upon requestWe provide the customer with the highest level of hotel services to increase comfort and privacy:Professional daily cleaningLaundry and ironingDelivery of groceries and household needsAirport pick up / drop offRenting cars of multiple categoriesProviding a private chef to prepare special meals inside the apartment📜 Housing ConditionsCheck-in after 2:00 PMCheck out before 12:00 PMNo partiesKeep quiet after 11 pmProvide a copy of your passport or ID 24 hours before arrival Refundable insurance is required",False,402,False,True,False,,nan
