1507773124366821109,Jacuzzi Studio By The Historic Pyramids (Apt.3),https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1507773124366821109?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-04&check_out=2026-05-09,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1507773124366821109/original/49136033-ff05-43f7-87f7-3c0d3650b582.jpeg,29.97727,31.14582,4.9,20.0,4.9,4.85,4.85,4.95,518,518,0,"Welcome to one of the most iconic stays in Giza, with unmatched views of the Pyramids. Enjoy the breathtaking sight of all three pyramids from anywhere inside this modern oriental studio, or while relaxing in your private in-room jacuzzi.Thoughtfully designed for comfort and authenticity, the apartment offers an ideal base steps from one of the world’s greatest wonders.All photos are 100% real, and guests are welcome to explore our other listings and unique local experiences.The spaceThis bright and cozy studio is designed for relaxation and comfort  the perfect retreat after a day spent exploring the pyramids and the vibrant streets of Giza.Inside, you’ll find:✔️ A private indoor jacuzzi, thoroughly cleaned and sanitized before every stay✔️ One queen-sized bed with hotel-quality Egyptian cotton linens✔️ A bathroom stocked with fresh face and body towels✔️ A compact kitchenette for light meal preparation✔️ Free Wi-Fi, Cable TV, and Chromecast✔️ A Nespresso machine✔️ Complimentary bottled water and two coffee capsules.Guest access✔️Guests will have full private access to the Apartment and all of its amenities during their stay.✔️For larger groups or multiple bookings, feel free to contact us — we may have additional units available in the same building or nearby.Other things to note⚠️ Electricity or water outages may occasionally occur due to infrastructure maintenance in the area. While this is beyond our control, we’ll do our best to assist you if it affects your stay.✔️The rooftop is part of the building but not managed or maintained by us. We are not responsible for its access, safety, or cleanliness.✔️We kindly ask that you treat the space with care and leave it tidy at check-out.",True,268,True,True,False,,nan
