1372349170837637381,Golf View Penthouse | Rooftop Jacuzzi · 5BR ·,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1372349170837637381?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTM3MjM0OTE3MDgzNzYzNzM4MQ==/original/9e3c36b4-e10b-4fc6-aef5-44811eaeb935.jpeg,30.0122,31.443,5.0,11.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.91,"2,975","$3,500",-$525.00,"Wake up to a golf course. Step onto your rooftop. Sink into your private Jacuzzi.This is the only penthouse in Kattameya Dunes with a first-row golf view, a private rooftop Jacuzzi, and a dedicated in-unit escalator — three things you will not find in any other listing in Cairo.The spaceThe penthouse :Spread across multiple floors connected by your own private escalator, this is not an apartment ,it is a residence. Five bedrooms including two full master suites, each with a private en-suite bathroom and premium finishes. The remaining bedrooms are generously sized and ideal for families, children, or additional guests. Every space is designed for elegance, not just comfort.The rooftop:This is what sets this penthouse apart entirely. Step up to your private rooftop terrace and you are met with an uninterrupted panoramic view over the Kattameya Dunes golf course one of Cairo's most prestigious. Your Jacuzzi is up here. Morning coffee is up here. Sunset gatherings are up here. It is the kind of outdoor space most hotels cannot offer.Your services :Private chef available for breakfast, lunch, and dinner prepared in your fully equipped kitchen and served wherever you choose. Airport pickup and drop-off arranged in advance. Special occasion setups, florals available on request.Your location :Inside the exclusive Kattameya Dunes compound with 24/7 security. Minutes from New Cairo's finest dining, retail, and entertainment. Easy access to the AUC, Downtown Katameya, and Cairo International Airport.",True,234,False,True,False,,nan
15490900,Abusir Pyramids Retreat,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/15490900?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-04&check_out=2026-05-09,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/miso/Hosting-15490900/original/21e97ad6-56bb-4625-b473-b59970c3218a.jpeg,29.8995,31.2077,4.94,133.0,4.95,4.86,4.88,4.65,"3,501","3,501",0,"Wake up to the breathtaking view of the ancient Abusir pyramids right before you.Stunning 5-bedroom villa with guesthouse, pool, lush garden, gym, playroom & treehouse. Sleeps 10.Designed by award-winning architect Ahmad Hamid (2010 World Architecture Award), inspired by Hassan Fathy.20 min to Giza Pyramids & Grand Egyptian Museum.Art collection personally curated by owner Taya Elzayadi.Private chef available for hire.A peaceful family-friendly retreat where history, art, and luxury meet.The spaceStep into a soaring double-height, open-plan living space warmed by a grand fireplace and enriched by an exceptional contemporary Egyptian art collection.The villa offers a sleek open kitchen plus a spacious second kitchen for seamless hosting. Three luxurious en-suite bedrooms are found in the main house; the separate guesthouse adds two more en-suite bedrooms, a kitchenette, and its own living area.Outside, enjoy a private pool, gym, ping-pong table,  BBQ, outdoor fireplace, shaded terraces, and an expansive garden blooming with fruit trees and a whimsical treehouse for children.Wi-Fi available. Ideal for families or groups of friends.Guest accessAll the spaces except staff housing (which is a separate building).  This includes main villa, garden, pool, outdoor BBQ and terraces, and guesthouse.Other things to noteAny sightseeing is advised to be booked in advance.  We can help book transport and guides. We have set menus that the chef can prepare but must be ordered 3 days in advance.WiFi is available.",True,223,True,True,False,Ancient Abusir pyramids,nan
1604103429022591602,The Only 5 En-Suite Pool Villa Inside CFC,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1604103429022591602?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1604103429022591602/original/64dabe38-78cf-45ba-8f26-b9143b007c67.jpeg,30.03626,31.41681,5.0,3.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,"2,912","2,912",0,"Five private suites. One villa. Everything arranged.This is not a typical Airbnb. It is a fully serviced, hotel-grade private villa inside Cairo Festival City one of New Cairo’s most prestigious gated compounds. From your private chef to your airport transfer, every detail is handled before you arrive.The spaceThe suites :Five bedrooms. Every single one a master suite with its own private en-suite bathroom, king bed, premium hotel-grade bedding, and blackout curtains. No shared bathrooms. No compromises. Whether you are a family of ten, a group of executives, or celebrating a milestone — every guest sleeps like a VIP.The villa :Your private pool and landscaped garden are waiting. Mornings here look like this: breakfast prepared by your private chef, served poolside, with nothing on the agenda unless you choose it. The open-plan living and dining areas are generous, light-filled, and finished to five-star standard throughout — built for families who gather, groups who celebrate, and guests who simply refuse to settle.Your servicesThis villa comes with a full concierge service if needed. Your private chef handles breakfast, lunch, and dinner , customised to your group. Your airport transfer is arranged in advance, door to door. Need  a flower arrangement, or a special setup for a celebration? Consider it done.Your locationInside CFC you have 24/7 compound security and immaculate landscaped streets. Within five minutes: VOX Cinemas, KidZania, luxury retail, the CFC waterfront promenade, and New Cairo’s finest restaurants and cafés. The airport is 25 minutes away. The New Capital is 20 minutes. Downtown Katameya, Point 90, and the AUC are all within easy reach.",True,261,False,True,False,'main',nan
42146441,Abu Sir Pyramids & Palm view villa newly renovated,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/42146441?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-42146441/original/0a353a6c-52e0-440d-9a64-6e4177913a56.jpeg,29.8918,31.2197,4.81,73.0,4.89,4.88,4.63,4.59,"3,209","$3,909",0,"Stylish home overlooking Abu Sir pyramids. Very unique placeThe spaceThis stunning villa is the perfect retreat for those seeking a luxurious and comfortable stay in Abu Sir. The villa's unique location overlooking the pyramids provides guests with an unforgettable experience. The spacious living room is beautifully decorated and offers direct views of the pyramids and pool. The dining area, fireplace seating area, and fully equipped kitchen create the perfect space for entertaining and enjoying meals with family and friends. The large TV room is perfect for relaxing after a long day of sightseeing.The guest room on the main floor is elegantly furnished with a queen bed and a marble bathroom. Upstairs, the bedrooms are equally stylish and comfortable. The balcony overlooking the pyramids and pool is the perfect spot for a morning coffee or evening cocktail. The master bedroom is a true oasis, featuring a large en suite bathroom, a dressing room, and a cozy fireplace seating area. The two kids bedrooms are perfect for families, with single beds, bunk beds, and a sofa bed.The pool house is a fantastic addition to the villa, offering guests a chance to relax and unwind by the pool. The outdoor bar and BBQ make it easy to enjoy meals outside, while the full bathroom and two showers provide added convenience. The second master bedroom is connected to a playroom with a ping-pong table, billiard table, and drums, making it the perfect spot for kids to have fun. Overall, this stylish home offers everything you need for an unforgettable stay in Abu Sir.Guest accessAllOther things to noteWiFi is available with certain limit up on check in. If guest need more GB this with extra fees. For medium/ long term guest will pay utility bill of water and electricity consumption.",True,295,True,True,False,"""The main view""",nan
