ll the essentials + TV 🛌✔ Bedroom 5: 2 single beds + floor mattress . Very cozy and simple 💫✔ Bedroom 6: Single bed + TV + iron + heating + storage 🌼✔ Bedroom 7: 2 single beds + couch + 2 floor mattresses + TV + extra blankets 💤★The Bathrooms★ 4 sparkling full bathrooms 🚿✨ each with;• Air conditioning• Hot water• Shampoo• Body wash• And hair dryers.  Whether you’re cooking, chilling, working out, or just relaxing, this home is ready to give you the perfect stay.",True,354,False,False,False,"""Nile""",nan
