890931947722707877,"House of Kheops ""Under the Great Pyramid""",https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/890931947722707877?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-08&check_out=2026-05-13,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-890931947722707877/original/e44a6824-64e9-4e8b-a189-1c128960d75a.jpeg,29.98656,31.109,4.75,8.0,4.88,4.88,4.63,5.0,"3,997","3,997",0,"The House of Kheops is an iconic Cultural Oasis nestled beneath the Great Pyramid of Giza. The house is renouned for its peace and tranquility & warm and friendly energy. Gaze at the Great Pyramid Views from our Garden or marvel at the arquitectural design of our Observatory. Swim in the pool and relax! We offer the Entire House for private stays, including 4 rooms (double beds), on suite and detached bathrooms, Garden and Pool, Large Observatory.  Meals are also available on request.The spaceThe House is made of 4 unique rooms offering different character, colours, and styles. Each has Queen size beds offering to 4 singles or 8 shared beds. Additional put up beds are also available for extra spaces.Our bathrooms are 2 ensuite, 1 attached and 1 detached.Our Garden area offers a comforting experience for thos ewishing to unwind and relax, and the pool is available for all guests.The kitchen staff provide service for guests during most of the day.The Observatory is our sacred temple by night, View point by day.Guest accessGuests have access to all spaces of the house, except the staff room which is at the far end of the hallway in the garden.Other things to noteIf you need anything at anytime  or there are any issues at the house, please do not hesitate to ask for help or assistance and our staff can sort it out for you, they are always ready to help and we dont wish for any guests to be uncomfrtable. Thank you.",True,250,False,True,True,The main view,nan
