1587607580438846565,"St. Regis, 3 Bedroom Suite, Partial Nile view",https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1587607580438846565?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1587607580438846565/original/b5649a2c-6224-4f2b-b88e-35ab88cc2085.jpeg,30.0629,31.2279,5.0,1.0,4.0,5.0,3.0,5.0,"3,063","$3,717",-$654.00,"This Apartment is Offered By Dhbstays , The 2-Bedroom Partial Nile View suite atthe St. Regis Hotel offers an blend of luxury, comfort, andbreathtaking views. With two elegantly appointed bedrooms, this suiteis designed for both relaxation and sophistication, making it ideal forfamilies or those seeking extra space. Floor-to-ceiling windows framepanoramic views of the iconic Nile River, offering a serene andpicturesque backdrop.The spaceThe spaceFor Arab passport holders, couples must submit an official marriagecertificate. Visitors of the opposite sex are not allowed unlessthey're first degree relatives.Cancellation PolicyFull refund for cancellations made within 48 hours of booking, if thecheck in date is at least 14 days away.50% refund for cancellations made at least 7 days before check in.No refunds for cancellations made within 7 days of check in.Late check-out PolicyLate check out requests are subject to availability.Check out between 1:00 AM till 15:00 PM on the same day of departure,guests will be charged 25% of the daily rate published on our website.Check out between 15:00 PM till 18:00 PM on the same day of departure,guests will be charged 50% of the daily rate published on our website.Check out after 18:00 PM on the same day of departure, guests will becharged full day charges of the daily rate published on our website.House RulesFor Arab passport holders, couples must submit an official marriagecertificate. Visitors of the opposite sex are not allowed Pets are not allowed (not even really cute ones) Parties are prohibited (not even really quiet ones).Please be respectful of your neighbors and keep noise to a minimum from10:00 Pm – 8:00 Am.We provide weekly housekeeping free of charge but daily housekeeping isfor extra fees ($30).Guest accessSelf check-in with smart lock",True,277,False,False,False,,nan
