1635798593420134671,Luxury condotel with a charming view of the Nile and the pyramids,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1635798593420134671?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1635798593420134671/original/fe7518b7-7324-468a-82ac-58aa379b9ec0.jpeg,29.98709,31.23052,4.8925321888412014,0.0,4.880128755364806,4.831845493562232,4.815214592274679,4.830793991416309,"4,000","$5,000","-$1,000.00","Bring the whole family to this wonderful home with plenty of space for fun, a panoramic view of the Nile and the pyramids, bedrooms overlooking the Nile, and a fully equipped working room.The spaceLuxury Royal Suite with views of the Nile, the pyramids, and Cairo, on the top floor of the Hilton Nile Maadi Tower, master bedrooms with full views of the Nile, three-bedroom apartment with master bedrooms and a bathtub A children's room with two beds, and an outdoor bathroom with a bathtub And a maid's or nanny's room with a private bathroomGuest accessThe apartment is 415 square meters (4,458 square feet). It is located in Hilton Nile Maadi, in the residential tower. Host name: Mohammed Imad; apartment number: A1; floor: 22 Three master bedrooms, each with its own private bathroom and bathtub The 4th room is a children's room with an outdoor bathroom with a bathtub. The fifth room is a maid's or nanny's room with a private bathroom.‭Other things to noteThe apartment is located in Maadi, at the Hilton Nile Maadi. Residential tower on the top floor (22nd floor) with a total area of 415 square meters and a panoramic view of the Nile, the pyramids, and the city.",False,202,False,False,False,Panoramic View of the Nile,nan
1427722712478374393,Spacious 6BR Villa With Swimming Pool,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1427722712478374393?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1427722712478374393/original/0c4fba10-02f3-4769-8689-9387f9922b33.jpeg,30.02281,31.48507,5.0,8.0,4.88,4.88,4.75,4.75,"3,200","3,200",0,"Welcome to this extraordinary 6-bedroom luxury townhouse, a masterpiece of contemporary elegance and comfort. Designed for those who seek the highest standard of living, this expansive residence features three master bedrooms, each with its own private ensuite bathroom and refined interior finishes that reflect modern sophistication.The outdoor area is a true retreat, centered around a private luxury swimming pool—ideal for both relaxing under the sun and hosting unforgettable gatherings.",True,69,False,True,False,,nan
921055669157802876,"VESTA Oriana Villas| 4BR With Pool, Cairo festival",https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/921055669157802876?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2027-04-01&check_out=2027-04-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-921055669157802876/original/613bd5f4-fbcb-4d7a-b209-e1037ff3f530.jpeg,30.0371,31.4161,4.8,5.0,4.8,4.8,4.6,4.6,"2,705","2,705",0,"Oriana Villa is located in Cairo Festival City, Cairo. A very fresh theme in the heart of New Cairo. Complimentary housekeeping is provided on the 7th day for stays of a full week. Additional housekeeping can be arranged via Airbnb messaging for an extra fee. Netflix and free Wi-Fi.The spaceVilla Specs: 4BR, 3 Bathrooms, 1 Guest Toilet, Full Kitchen, Reception, Dining Room.Amenities:- Wi-Fi (20GB max per day)- Netflix, AC, Private Parking- Pets accepted under request (depends on the breed) Instructions:- For any reservation, a photo for every passport for everyone who will be checking in should be provided at least one day before arrival day so we can provide them entry permits.- For any reservation confirmed same day of arrival, guest will be requested to send a photo for each passport for all the guests who will be checking in before 3 pm Cairo Local time,so, we can provide them entry permits, otherwise guest will not be able to enter the residential compound where this unit is located.- Online Payment is required 7 days before arrival to avoid automated cancellation- Guest will be requested to sign an online registration card upon arrival - Location and Keylock box code will be sent to the guest same day of check-in once payment is confirmed - Check-in from 03.00 PM to 08.00 PM- Check out is at 12.00 PM- No late check out is permitted - No early check in is permitted- Guest will be asked to provide an insurance deposit 300 USD that will be held from his credit card - Unmarried couples and mixed groups are not allowed- Proof of relation may be asked to be provided to us (example: Marriage Certificate) - Visitors are not allowed- Guest may be requested to provide a photo for a Valid Residence Visa or Valid Visit Residence to Egypt",True,305,True,False,False,"{'location': 'Oriana Villa', 'keylockboxcode': 'abc123', 'checkinTime': '03.00 PM', 'checkoutTime': '12.00 PM', 'noLateCheckOut': True, 'noEarlyCheckIn': True}",nan
583239323050291921,Stunning Villa near The Pyramids,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/583239323050291921?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-20&check_out=2026-05-25,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/miso/Hosting-583239323050291921/original/ffc3cc32-9bf0-4ec2-ab42-d656620c1ba6.jpeg,29.93014,31.18286,4.84,25.0,4.84,4.96,4.64,4.24,"2,986","2,986",0,"A villa nurtured through generations for nearly 40 years. What began as a farm, where the seeds of the now-lush trees were planted, has grown into a serene retreat. Carefully maintained over the years, it offers comfort and relaxation away from Cairo’s busy life. It feels like home the moment you arrive and is just 15 minutes from the Great Pyramids of Giza, Sakkara Pyramids, and 20 minutes from the Grand Egyptian Museum — the ideal base to explore Egypt’s iconic sites. Find us: @sakkararetreatThe spaceThe Full VillaRooftop Suite: Our Boho rooftop apartment, accessible via the main stairs, is a separate space and accommodates 4 guests, perfect for quiet retreats or creative work.First Floor: Features a master bedroom with en-suite bathroom and balcony overlooking the lush garden and pool. On the opposite side of the master, there are four unique bedrooms sharing two bathrooms, with a shared living room and kitchenette in between. This floor accommodates up to 10 guests comfortably.Ground Floor: Includes a very spacious reception area with a 12-seater dining table, all overlooking the luxurious pool, a bedroom with pool view and attached bathroom, and a fully equipped kitchen with two refrigerators and all appliances needed to create great meals. A laundry room is available upon request for an additional cost.Outdoors & Guest House: The villa is surrounded by a beautifully maintained garden, ideal for relaxation and outdoor activities. The guest house, with a separate entrance and panoramic garden views, includes a bedroom, bathroom, living room, kitchenette, and dining/office table — perfect for events, meetings, or retreats. Additional dining and seating areas throughout the garden make it ideal for yoga, gatherings, or outdoor leisure.Accommodations: The villa comfortably hosts up to 18 guests. All bedrooms include queen-sized double beds, except for the master suite, which features a king-sized bed.Location & TransportationOur villa is centrally located between the Pyramids of Giza and the Sakkara Pyramid, about 15 minutes from each. It is 30 minutes from downtown Cairo and about one hour from Cairo International Airport.Set in the countryside, the villa is surrounded by farms and open landscapes, offering an authentic local atmosphere and a true sense of Egypt’s rural life.Please note that Uber services can be unpredictable in the area. We recommend arranging transportation in advance or coordinating pick-up and drop-off with your tour service, which is usually included. For maximum convenience, we also offer private car service — please book in advance to ensure availability.FoodPlease note: Our villa is not reachable by food delivery services.Cook Your Own MealsOur very spacious kitchen is fully equipped with two refrigerators and all appliances you may need to prepare meals for your group. Groceries can be pre-ordered to arrive before your stay, allowing you to enjoy cooking and dining together in the villa’s main dining area.In-House Chef ServiceFor a more relaxing experience, we can arrange a private chef to prepare home-cooked meals for your group. Please check availability in advance to ensure your preferred schedule.We look forward to welcoming you to our villa and ensuring your stay in Egypt is comfortable, relaxing, and unforgettable. We are happy to provide recommendations to help you make the most of your time in our beloved country.Other things to noteEvents are separate from our accommodation and must be approved by host in advance. Event fees varies",True,549,False,True,False,,nan
