1616671277738523518,Elite Duplex | Private Pool | Lake View Residence,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1616671277738523518?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1616671277738523518/original/e9cd260e-422e-48ee-9461-1ac48bc79f4e.jpeg,30.02722,31.54131,5.0,1.0,5.0,5.0,4.0,5.0,"1,235","$1,420",0,"Elite duplex offering exceptional space and privacy. Features 3 bedrooms: 2 master suites and a third bedroom with a private bathroom (separate, not en-suite), plus a dedicated dressing room. Includes a nanny room with private bathroom and a guest toilet. Enjoy three large outdoor seating areas, a huge garden, and a private pool. Entertainment includes a billiard table and a 100-inch TV in the living area. The fully equipped kitchen has all essentials for a comfortable stay in Lake View.The spaceKITCHENA luxurious open American-style kitchen designed with premium finishes and high-end materials. Fully equipped with all essential appliances and utensils, it includes an oven, full-sized refrigerator, microwave, toaster, kettle, espresso machine, dishwasher, and washing machine. The open layout seamlessly connects to the living area, combining elegance and functionality for a refined cooking experience.⸻LIVING AREAAn expansive and sophisticated living space, thoughtfully designed for relaxation and entertaining. The area features a large, ultra-comfortable sofa and a 100-inch Smart TV, creating a cinematic experience at home. Elegant marble flooring enhances the luxurious ambiance, while the open layout provides a bright and welcoming atmosphere.⸻BEDROOMSThe apartment offers three beautifully designed bedrooms, including two master suites with private en-suite bathrooms, plus a third bedroom with its own independent privacy.• The first master bedroom features a king-size bed (180 x 200 cm).• The second master bedroom includes two single beds (130 x 200 cm each).• The third bedroom features a king-size bed (180 x 200 cm).In addition, there is a separate nanny’s room with its own private bathroom, offering complete independence and comfort.All bedrooms include built-in wardrobes and are crafted with fine details to ensure maximum comfort and restful sleep.⸻BATHROOMSThe apartment features multiple luxurious marble bathrooms, including the two master en-suites and an additional private bathroom for the nanny’s room. Each bathroom is finished with premium materials and equipped with walk-in shower cabins, along with high-quality towels, shampoo, and soap to ensure a refreshing and comfortable stay.⸻OUTDOOR & ENTERTAINMENTEnjoy a large private balcony with comfortable outdoor seating areas, perfect for relaxing with your morning coffee or enjoying the evening breeze.The property also includes access to a swimming pool, a billiards table, and beautifully arranged outdoor seating areas, offering both leisure and entertainment within a refined setting.⸻ADDITIONAL AMENITIESThe apartment features central air conditioning, high-speed Wi-Fi, complimentary Netflix for movies and series, and TOD access for streaming live matches worldwide. Every corner reflects a perfect balance of luxury, comfort, and high-end finishes, highlighted by elegant marble flooring throughout.Other things to notePlease note that : - The property is not designated for photography sessions or any type of parties or events.- Living room AC is temporarily out of order.",True,439,True,True,False,Lake View,nan
