private rooftop pool	•	24/7 secure access to the compound	•	The lake area, walking paths, kids’ area	•	Elevators and designated parkingOther things to noteMaximum occupancy: 8 guests	•	Registered guests only, no unregistered visitors allowed	•	The pool is not heated	•	Ideal for families and groups seeking comfort, privacy, and luxury	•	The compound is extremely safe with full-time securityLocation HighlightsLakeview Residence is one of the most premium communities in New Cairo:	•	1 minute from LakeTown — a new high-end mall with cafés, restaurants, a supermarket, and services	•	5 minutes from AUC	•	Close to Point 90, The Drive, Downtown Katameya, and top dining spots	•	Safe, walkable, quiet, and upscaleKindly note that, in accordance with Egyptian regulations, unmarried Arab couples are not permitted.Services available upon request:• Early check in• Late check in after 11 PM• Late check out• Airport pickup by sedan• Airport pickup van upgrade• After midnight airport pickup• Additional cleaningFor arrangements or inquiries regarding any of the above services, please contact us and we will be pleased to provide you with the relevant details and pricing.",True,444,False,True,False,,nan
