1470802297154260358,Nile View at Four Seasons 2BD with Crimson Chamber,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1470802297154260358?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-16&check_out=2026-05-21,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1470802297154260358/original/b6650b36-7265-4362-953e-85bc90909854.jpeg,30.03585,31.22828,4.8925321888412014,0.0,4.880128755364806,4.831845493562232,4.815214592274679,4.830793991416309,"3,191","3,191",0,"Experience hotel-level luxury with the privacy of your own residence inside the Four Seasons Nile Plaza.This two-bedroom suite blends refined, modern comfort with a bold, artistic edge—featuring a one-of-a-kind signature room designed as an immersive experience.The SpaceThe residence offers a spacious, elegant primary bedroom alongside a striking second suite—The Crimson Chamber—a dramatic, design-forward space curated with rich textures, sculptural art, and cinematic ambiance.The spaceLuxury Two-Bedroom Residence at Four Seasons Plaza with the Nile ViewExperience refined living in this elegant two-bedroom residence located within the prestigious Plaza Residences at Four Seasons Hotel Cairo at Nile Plaza.The apartment offers a perfect blend of comfort, privacy, and five-star hotel services, making it ideal for both short and extended stays.This two-bedroom suite blends refined, modern comfort with a bold, artistic edge—featuring a one-of-a-kind signature room designed as an immersive experience.ExperienceWhile the main living areas and primary bedroom reflect a calm, modern luxury aesthetic, the Crimson Chamber introduces a completely different mood—intimate, expressive, and visually captivating.Perfect for couples, creatives, or guests seeking a unique, story-driven stay.Important Note: Please note: The second bedroom features bold artistic design and may not suit guests seeking a minimal or conventional aesthetic. Families with young children may prefer using the primary bedroom. Amenities Guests enjoy full access to Four Seasons amenities including the pool, spa, and fitness center, along with optional room service—offering the perfect balance between private residence and world-class hotel living.Bar area with a wine fridgeFrom the large balcony, enjoy panoramic views of the Nile and Cairo’s skyline, and on clear days, you can even see the Pyramids — a truly unique experience.Hotel Privileges & ServicesGuests enjoy complimentary access to the hotel’s world-class facilities, including:Outdoor swimming pool (family friendly) and indoor heated spa pool (16+) Sauna, jacuzzi, cold plunge and fully equipped gymAccess to all hotel restaurants, lounges, and dining venues.In-room dining available24/7 cleaning and housekeeping servicesPrime LocationSituated in the heart of Cairo at Nile Plaza, the residence offers seamless access to the city’s finest dining, cultural landmarks, business districts, and nightlife — all while enjoying the privacy of a luxury serviced residence.Whether you’re visiting Cairo for business, leisure, or a special occasion, this residence offers an exceptional stay with the comfort of home and the services of a five-star hotel.Guest accessGuests will have complimentary  access to the gym and pool and paid access to all Four Seasons amenities and services, including house keeping, room service, spa services, laundry services, on-call doctor, transportation, dining at any of the Four Seasons' outlets/restaurants: The Bar (where most of Egypt’s rich, famous and expats hangout for cocktails, and doing business), Eight (Asian fusion), Riviera (Italian restaurant), Bullona (Mediterranean), Byblos (Lebanese) Zitouni (open 24/7). Guests also have access to the lobby lounge, which is happening all day and night, as well as Beyman cafe. Beyman is also accessible for those who want access to a variety of top fashion brand shopping. Concierge services are available from 6:00 am to midnight, and guest services are available 24/7.Other things to notePrivate Concierge & VIP ServicesAvailable Upon Request | Additional Fees ApplyFor guests seeking an elevated experience, we offer a curated selection of private concierge and VIP services, subject to availability and advance arrangement:VIP airport meet and greet at the airport only.Private airport and city transportation.Private tour guides and bespoke excursions.Private chef experience.Dining, nightlife, and entertainment recommendations.Shopping and lifestyle experiences.Please contact us via Airbnb messaging to arrange any of these services.",False,566,False,True,False,Nile view,nan
