1200336845948322247,Alsawah | Luxe 7BR All Ensuite @Palm Hills Golf Ex,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1200336845948322247?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/miso/Hosting-1200336845948322247/original/b834cdd3-3e22-4d94-941c-8a029bd49620.jpeg,29.99529243616239,31.03939316720273,5.0,2.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,"3,450","3,450",0,"Step into quiet luxury. This serene 7-bedroom villa sits in the heart of Palm Hills Golf Extension, Cairo’s most refined, green-lined gated community. Each bedroom is a private suite with its own en-suite bathroom, offering comfort and personal space for every guest. Whether you're an expat family seeking stability, a couple looking for a peaceful escape, or a group wanting to reconnect in style, this home was designed to help you slow down, breathe deeper, and feel instantly at ease.The spaceIt’s a home built for families, couples, and long-term guests who appreciate space, security, and a slower rhythm of living.From the moment you walk through the door, you’ll notice how this home invites you in not just with size, but with warmth. The entry foyer opens into an expansive living area where sunlight spills through tall windows, bouncing gently off polished marble floors. Neutral tones and soft textures create a sense of peace, while rich wooden details and carefully chosen décor give the space a quiet sophistication.The living and dining areas flow together in an open-plan layout that makes conversations effortless, and gatherings feel natural. Curl up on one of the oversized sofas with a book, or enjoy a long, slow meal at the dining table under the soft glow of the chandelier. In the evening, recessed lights dim to create just the right atmosphere for a peaceful night in.Bedrooms:This home offers seven master bedrooms, and yes every single one has its own en-suite bathroom. Each suite feels like its own little sanctuary, with soft linens, plush headboards, and blackout electric shutters you can close with the touch of a button. Most rooms have walk-in closets and quiet spots to get ready think vanity tables or cozy chairs by the window. The upstairs suites offer even more privacy, while one ground-floor rooms make the villa accessible for all guests.Bathrooms:Each en-suite bathroom is immaculately finished, with elegant porcelain tiling, rain showers, and spacious countertops. One suite even includes a deep soaking tub, perfect for a long bath after a busy day. You’ll find bright mirrors, fluffy towels, and those little details that turn routine into ritual.Kitchen & Dining:At the center of the home is a chef-worthy kitchen sleek granite countertops, premium appliances, and plenty of room to prep, cook, or simply gather over coffee. There’s a breakfast nook by the window that looks out onto the garden a lovely spot for morning tea or quiet journaling. Nearby, a formal dining space comfortably fits the whole group, making shared meals feel special.Upstairs family lounge:Upstairs, there’s a second living space a relaxed family room with a large smart TV, cozy armchairs, and a quieter feel. It’s ideal for movie nights, kids’ downtime, or when everyone just wants their own corner to unwind.Tech & Comfort:The villa is fully climate-controlled with whisper-quiet AC throughout. Also, there’s high-speed Wi-Fi. It’s smart without being sterile the kind of tech that supports your stay without ever distracting from it.Outdoor space:Step outside through the sliding glass doors and you’re in your own private garden oasis. A manicured lawn stretches out under your feet, with palm trees swaying gently around the edges. There’s a shaded patio with comfortable lounge chairs, a dining area for outdoor meals, and a few hidden corners perfect for quiet reading or yoga in the morning sun.At night, soft garden lighting creates a warm glow, and the air cools just enough for stargazing or a late-night tea. It’s the kind of outdoor space that makes you linger a little longer peaceful, private, and easy to enjoy.The compound / location:Palm Hills Golf Extension is one of Sheikh Zayed’s most secure, upscale neighborhoods and it shows. Wide, quiet streets lined with trees and flowers. Elegant villas and peaceful walking paths. A private, gated entry with 24/7 security ensures total peace of mind.You’re right near the Palm Hills golf course, and a short walk or drive gets you to the clubhouse and green spaces. Families love it here for the safety and community. Expats love the quiet and the ease of access to Cairo.Even better, you're just minutes from:Mall of Arabia - 10 minsMall of Egypt - 15 minsSupermarkets, pharmacies, and schools in 6th of OctoberDowntown Cairo or the Giza Pyramids - 30-40 minsThis is a location that lets you step back from the buzz of the city, without ever feeling far from what you need.Guest accessWhen you stay here, the entire villa is yours. All seven bedrooms, all the living spaces, the garden, the kitchen, the laundry everything. The villa has its own gated entrance and private driveway with space for several cars. Come and go whenever you like and enjoy the full privacy of a standalone home.Within the compound, you’re welcome to explore the surrounding streets and gardens.",True,791,True,False,False,,nan
1093452352113471451,Luxury 4-Floor Villa with Pyramids Panoramic view,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1093452352113471451?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-04&check_out=2026-05-09,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1093452352113471451/original/9f51246c-3423-400d-933a-4a0de5e00c96.jpeg,30.0127,31.1044,4.94,18.0,4.94,4.78,4.94,4.89,"1,259","1,259",0,"✨ Luxury Villa Facing the Grand Egyptian Museum & Pyramids ✨ ( 4 floors villa ) this stunning 5-bedroom private villa with a private pool and 1200 m² of spacious indoor living — all set directly in front of the Grand Egyptian Museum and just minutes from the Pyramids.a fully equipped kitchen, fast WiFi, and plenty of outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining. Perfect for families, groups, and anyone seeking comfort with world-class views.A housekeeper is included (optional)The spaceBedrooms	•	5 Spacious Bedrooms designed for comfort and privacy	•	Each room includes a private ensuite bathroom	•	Master Suites feature larger layouts, premium bedding, and upgraded finishes	•	Every bedroom is equipped with a personal mini-fridge for added convenience	•	Ideal for families and groups wanting both luxury and independenceGuest accessGuest AccessGuests will enjoy full private access to the entire villa, including:	•	The private swimming pool and outdoor lounging areas	•	All 5 bedrooms, each with its own ensuite bathroom and mini-fridge	•	The spacious 1200 m² indoor living areas, kitchens, and dining spaces	•	Private terraces and relaxation spots	•	On-site parking and secure entrancesThe villa is exclusively yours throughout your stay—no shared spaces, no interruptions. Relax, unwind, and enjoy complete privacy in a prime location facing the Grand Egyptian Museum and the Pyramids.Other things to noteHousekeeping ServiceA dedicated housekeeper is available during your stay to ensure the villa remains clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. Daily cleaning, fresh towels, and general upkeep can be provided upon request.",True,248,True,True,False,"""The main view or location feature""",nan
1623416388591439901,Bayt Shorouk Oasis - Your Chic Green Escape-Nesty,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1623416388591439901?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-11&check_out=2026-05-16,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1623416388591439901/original/818d0ad7-4449-4eae-8e48-85f351b834d9.jpeg,30.0212,31.1001,5.0,2.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,"1,358","1,358",0,"Bayt Shorouk, a newly renovated villa tucked inside the private, gated Garana Compound, one of the most peaceful and secure communities. Think of it as your own lush sanctuary in Cairo, where calm, style, and space come together beautifully.You’ll be staying just:• 10 minutes - Grand Egyptian Museum• 15 minutes - Great Pyramids of Giza• 20 minutes from Saqqara• 25 minutes from Downtown Cairo’s vibrant chaosSo you get the magic of ancient Egypt and the comfort of your own quiet oasis.The space🌿 Bayt Shorouk is designed for travelers who want a genuine yet chic Cairo experience. The villa is spacious, airy, and full of peaceful energy — every corner styled with taste, warmth, and intention.Inside, you’ll find:• 4 spacious en‑suite bedrooms, each offering privacy and comfort• A massive, fully equipped kitchen perfect for cooking, gathering, or hosting• A huge living area with beautiful décor and cozy furniture• A lavish outdoor green space with seating, shade, and room to breatheAnd then there’s the showstopper…💦 A stunning, artistic, Moroccan‑designed swimming pool that cools Cairo’s heat and adds a touch of resort‑style magic to your stay. Morning dips, sunset swims, or late‑night lounging — it’s all yours.🌼 The 4th bedroom is a stand‑alone garden suite, ideal for:• Elderly guests• Guests who prefer privacy• A nanny or service staff• Anyone who loves waking up directly to sunshine and greeneryIt has its own easy access in and out of the villa.🚗 You’ll have private parking for up to 4 cars, and the villa sits inside Palma Vera, a quiet, premium enclave within Garana Compound — fully gated, secure, and surrounded by greenery.🎉 Just steps away, Seasons Country Club offers guests:• Great restaurants and cafés• Beautiful walking paths• Sports facilities• Family‑friendly entertainment• A refined, resort‑like atmosphereIt’s the perfect add‑on to your stay — whether you want a good meal, a fun outing, or a relaxing afternoon.✨ Bayt Shorouk Oasis is perfect for:• Couples seeking a romantic, stylish escape• Families wanting space, safety, and comfort• Friends exploring Cairo together• Travelers who want to be close to Egypt’s greatest treasures while staying somewhere peaceful, chic, and uniqueThis is your hidden gem — a place where Cairo’s energy meets calm, greenery, and effortless style.Guest accessGuests have access to the entire Villa and spaceOther things to note- We provide you with a complimentary premium airport shuttle from Cairo to Bayt Shorouk Oasis.- It's a gated, safe community- You can walk, you can request an Uber ride, or you can hail a taxi at any time.- We can make arrangements and help with your trip details.- We can provide you with a safe, comfortable car with a private driver (please arrange in advance before your arrival).- For your convenience, we offer extra and daily housekeeping services upon request. - We will provide you with a grocery and food delivery app that delivers whatever you need to your doorstep.- Smoking is allowed in the garden onlyTo our Egyptian and Arab brothers and sisters:To ensure compliance with the building management's instructions and the local regulations of the Ministry of Interior, mixed-gender stays and visits are permitted only for married couples or first-degree relatives.Therefore, prior to your arrival, please provide us with an official document proving your family relationship or marriage.If the required document is not provided or if the booking details do not comply with these terms, we may, unfortunately, be forced to cancel the booking before or upon arrival and vacate the unit immediately without any refund, and we will notify the relevant authorities in accordance with the applicable regulations.We appreciate your understanding and cooperation, and we look forward to hosting you and providing you with a comfortable stay.",True,607,False,True,False,"The main view or location feature (e.g., pyramids view, Nile view , city center, balcony with view)",nan
1275570156151904939,Lux private home Sheikh zayed,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1275570156151904939?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1275570156151904939/original/90c97785-8407-44a8-93a6-943a8b9bdeba.jpeg,30.037954460420423,30.961577282489856,4.92,62.0,4.89,4.94,4.89,4.92,"1,464","1,464",0,"Make some memories at this unique and family-friendly place. Full of private house with private entrance/parking & private swimming pool , Enjoy fantastic stay in the green space with your friends &panorama view from All the rooms . the property In the most attractive area in Egypt -Sheikh Zayed City . -Two minutes from tourist walk street of Sheikh Zayed -Enjoy the entertainment and Restaurants&Coffee -7 minutes from Egypt Mall -5 Minutes from Mall Al Arab -10 Minutes from AlHossary Square",True,81,False,True,False,"""View""",nan
1445646500819337593,3 Rooms l Cairo Group Stay w/ Pool & Spa Access,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1445646500819337593?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1445646500819337593/original/5533affb-46f4-4225-a4cf-7c1cb1d0b319.jpeg,30.080555,30.905894,4.8925321888412014,0.0,4.880128755364806,4.831845493562232,4.815214592274679,4.830793991416309,"3,258","$3,896",-$637.83,"Ultimate escape in Cairo, just steps from the Great Pyramids—where mornings begin by the pool, afternoons unfold in the spa or on city tours, and evenings wind down with live music and cocktails. With family perks like a kids’ club and playground, plus top dining and nearby horseback rides, this resort blends comfort with a touch of wonder.The spaceThis listing is for 3 separate rooms within a hotel. The price shown in the listing covers all 3 rooms.✦ Each room is 258 sq. ft, equipped with complimentary toiletries, TV.✦ Rooms are not adjoining and possibly not next to each other. Spaces are assigned upon arrival based on availability.✦ Daily cleaning services included in the nightly price.There are a few additional details to know before you book:✦ The minimum age required for check-in is 18 years old.✦ Please ensure you have a valid ID for check-in, as it is mandatory for entry.Guest accessDuring your stay, you will have access to the property and amenities according to the following schedule:✦ Check-in is available from 2:00PM.✦ Fitness center is available.✦ Outdoor pool available all year.Other things to noteThere are several additional things to note:✦ Pets are not allowed.✦ We use multi-unit listings, so rooms are similar but may have small differences.✦ Self-parking is available (parking slot reservation is not required in advance) and costs USD 3.20 per day.✦ In Egypt, only married Egyptian couples are legally allowed to share the same hotel room.",False,240,False,True,False,"{""location"": ""The main view or location feature"", ""location_type"": ""Great Pyramids""}",nan
