1429721009267866412,Al Sawah | 6BR Villa w / Private Pool in Al Karma 1,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1429721009267866412?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1429721009267866412/original/e2c4a6a1-8c3b-4648-8b73-6d3108f774c6.jpeg,30.02722261951549,30.99687867658561,4.8925321888412014,0.0,4.880128755364806,4.831845493562232,4.815214592274679,4.830793991416309,"3,845","3,845",0,"About this space:Experience unparalleled luxury in this exquisite 6-bedroom with en-suite bathrooms villa located in the prestigious El Karma 1 compound, Sheikh Zayed. Spanning 1,200 sqm of refined living space on an 1,800 sqm plot, this fully furnished palace offers a harmonious blend of elegance, comfort, and modern amenities. Whether you're seeking a serene family retreat or an opulent getaway, this villa provides the perfect setting.The spaceThis grand villa is thoughtfully designed across multiple levels to cater to all your needs:Bedrooms & Bathrooms: Six spacious bedrooms, each featuring en-suite bathrooms and walk-in closets, ensuring privacy and convenience for all guests.Living Areas: Hotel-style reception areas on both the ground and first floors, adorned with elegant tree-inspired designs and offering breathtaking views.Kitchen & Dining: A fully equipped main kitchen overlooking the landscaped garden, complemented by a secondary kitchen in the basement.Basement: Includes additional rooms, a kitchen, and a guard's room with a private bathroom.Outdoor Amenities: A large private swimming pool, newly landscaped garden, and a fully equipped Bedouin-style tent for relaxation.Additional Features: A rooftop master suite with a private bathroom, nanny's room with separate access, digital screens in all rooms, and an internal elevator connecting all floors.The compound/location:Situated in the heart of Sheikh Zayed, El Karma 1 is a secure and prestigious compound known for its tranquility and prime location. Directly opposite Arkan Plaza, residents have easy access to shopping, dining, and entertainment options. The compound offers 24/7 security, landscaped communal areas, and a peaceful environment, making it ideal for families and discerning guests.Guest accessGuests will have exclusive access to the entire villa, including all amenities mentioned in the Listing.Other things to noteAdditional services are available upon request:Daily Housekeeping: EGP 500/dayCar Rental: With or without driver, starting from EGP 2,000/dayAirport Pickup: VIP service from the plane stairs with lounge access, starting from $350",False,301,False,True,False,pyramids,nan
1440898402444133817,Aura Room @Space Home,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1440898402444133817?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1440898402444133817/original/b24e9a1d-a3f2-4b74-a19a-6011c9ddb91b.jpeg,29.9567,31.2781,5.0,4.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,"2,536","2,536",0,"Step into the Aura Room at Space Home — a calm and cozy retreat designed for relaxation. The room features a comfortable double bed, soft lighting, and a peaceful vibe where you can unwind, read a book, or simply enjoy a quiet moment. Located in lively Maadi, you’ll be close to cafés, shops, and all essentials, yet have a serene space to return to. We can’t wait to welcome you and make your stay in Cairo effortless and enjoyable.The spaceThe Room:The Aura Room is a calm and cozy retreat in our Maadi apartment, designed to make you feel completely at ease. The comfy double bed is perfect for curling up with a book, catching up on sleep, or simply relaxing after a day exploring Cairo. Soft, warm lighting creates a peaceful and inviting atmosphere, making it easy to unwind in the evening or enjoy a quiet moment for yourself.The Space:Our three-bedroom apartment in Maadi is big, quiet, and full of natural light. Guests often say it feels more like a home than a rental — which is exactly the vibe we want. You’ll find three shared living areas where you can relax, work, or chat with fellow travelers. The kitchen is fully equipped with everything you need, whether you’re cooking something special or just throwing together a quick bite. The apartment stays peaceful, but step outside and you’re close to cafés, shops, and the lively streets of Maadi. It’s the best of both worlds — calm when you need it, lively when you want itGuest accessYou’re welcome to make yourself at home in the living room, which has two comfy seating areas and a dining table — great for meals, working, or just relaxing in the sunlight. The kitchen is fully equipped if you’d like to cook, from quick snacks to proper dinners. You’ll also have a clean and tidy bathroom available. The space is yours to enjoy — we want you to feel as comfortable here as you would in your own home.During your stayWe’re always happy to help! If you need anything during your stay — whether it’s tips about Maadi, help around the apartment, or just a good café recommendation — you can reach us easily by phone or message. You’ll have plenty of space to enjoy your trip, but we’re nearby if you ever need support.Other things to noteAll you need to know before coming is that the apartment is ready for you to enjoy. It’s sunny, comfortable, and thoughtfully prepared so you can feel at ease right away. Think of it as your home base in Maadi — a place to rest, recharge, and make the most of your stay.",True,445,False,False,False,,nan
