ust relaxing in the sunlight. The kitchen is fully equipped if you’d like to cook, from quick snacks to proper dinners. You’ll also have a clean and tidy bathroom available. The space is yours to enjoy — we want you to feel as comfortable here as you would in your own home.During your stayWe’re always happy to help! If you need anything during your stay — whether it’s tips about Maadi, help around the apartment, or just a good café recommendation — you can reach us easily by phone or message. You’ll have plenty of space to enjoy your trip, but we’re nearby if you ever need support.Other things to noteAll you need to know before coming is that the apartment is ready for you to enjoy. It’s sunny, comfortable, and thoughtfully prepared so you can feel at ease right away. Think of it as your home base in Maadi — a place to rest, recharge, and make the most of your stay.",True,461,False,False,False,balcony,nan
