. Additionally, this level includes two well-appointed bedrooms, each with double beds, and a shared bathroom located nearby.Fourth FloorThe top floor boasts a comfortable sofa bed and opens up to a massive rooftop terrace. This area is perfect for soaking in panoramic views of the surrounding gardens and compound while enjoying serene mornings or magical sunsets.Whether you’re looking to relax in the garden, unwind in the wellness facilities, or savor breathtaking views from the rooftop, this villa promises an exceptional stay. Book now and experience unmatched comfort and luxury!Guest accessGuests have exclusive access to the entire villa, including all four levels, ensuring complete privacy during your stay. Enjoy the beautifully landscaped front garden, perfect for relaxing or socializing. Make use of the open-plan kitchen equipped with all modern appliances for convenient cooking and dining.Indulge in the wellness amenities, including a private sauna, steam room, and jacuzzi, located on the third level. The spacious rooftop terrace is yours to enjoy, offering stunning views of the gardens and surrounding compound—a perfect spot for morning coffee or evening relaxation.The villa is your home away from home, and we ensure that every area is yours to enjoy freely, providing comfort, convenience, and exclusivity for a memorable stay.Other things to noteKindly note that due to the Egyptian laws and regulations, I ask guests to submit a copy of their IDs or passports in addition to a Copy of Marriage proof For Couples.",False,467,False,True,False,The main view or location feature,nan
