1033874472880546491,Alsawah | Lux Villa w/Private Pool in Sheikh Zayed,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1033874472880546491?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTAzMzg3NDQ3Mjg4MDU0NjQ5MQ%3D%3D/original/175c8f75-c869-41a3-9456-1d9cf7768f4f.jpeg,30.06916,30.94808,5.0,1.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,"2,825","2,825",0,"Experience unparalleled luxury in this stunning villa located in the prestigious Beverly Hills (Allegria) compound of Sheikh Zayed City. Designed for comfort and elegance, this spacious home offers a serene retreat with top-tier amenities, ensuring a memorable stay for families and groups seeking both relaxation and sophistication.The spaceThis expansive villa boasts:6 Bedrooms: Each room is thoughtfully designed, providing ample space and comfort.5 Bathrooms: Modern fixtures and finishes ensure a refreshing experience.Private Pool: Dive into your own oasis, perfect for unwinding or entertaining.Sauna & Steam Room: Rejuvenate your senses in the in-house wellness facilities.Jacuzzi: Relax and soak in luxury after a day of exploration.Garage: Secure parking for your convenience.The villa's design seamlessly blends modern aesthetics with functional living spaces, ensuring guests feel both pampered and at home.",True,126,False,True,False,"{""main view"":""pyramids""}",nan
1440898086586976039,Soul Room @SpaceHome,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1440898086586976039?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1440898086586976039/original/19e2927e-0243-4e2d-ac08-f4939ee8b900.jpeg,29.95727,31.27693,5.0,3.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.67,"2,505","2,505",0,"Welcome to the Soul Room at Space Home — a bright and spacious retreat full of good vibes. The room features a comfortable bed, soft natural light, and an uplifting atmosphere where you can relax, read, or simply enjoy a peaceful moment. Located in lively Maadi, you’ll be close to cafés, shops, and all essentials, yet have a cheerful space to return to. We can’t wait to host you and make your stay in Cairo happy and effortless.The spaceThe Room:The Soul Room is a bright and spacious retreat in our Maadi apartment, designed to fill you with positive vibes. The comfortable bed is perfect for curling up with a book, resting after a day exploring Cairo, or simply relaxing and enjoying peaceful moments. Sunlight streams through the windows, creating an uplifting and cheerful atmosphere that makes it easy to unwind, recharge, or just soak in the good energy.The Space:Our three-bedroom apartment in Maadi is big, quiet, and full of natural light. Guests often say it feels more like a home than a rental — which is exactly the vibe we want. You’ll find three shared living areas where you can relax, work, or chat with fellow travelers. The kitchen is fully equipped with everything you need, whether you’re cooking something special or just throwing together a quick bite. The apartment stays peaceful, but step outside and you’re close to cafés, shops, and the lively streets of Maadi. It’s the best of both worlds — calm when you need it, lively when you want itGuest accessYou’re welcome to make yourself at home in the living room, which has two comfy seating areas and a dining table — great for meals, working, or just relaxing in the sunlight. The kitchen is fully equipped if you’d like to cook, from quick snacks to proper dinners. You’ll also have a clean and tidy bathroom available. The space is yours to enjoy — we want you to feel as comfortable here as you would in your own home.During your stayWe’re always happy to help! If you need anything during your stay — whether it’s tips about Maadi, help around the apartment, or just a good café recommendation — you can reach us easily by phone or message. You’ll have plenty of space to enjoy your trip, but we’re nearby if you ever need support.Other things to noteAll you need to know before coming is that the apartment is ready for you to enjoy. It’s sunny, comfortable, and thoughtfully prepared so you can feel at ease right away. Think of it as your home base in Maadi — a place to rest, recharge, and make the most of your stay.",True,444,False,False,False,The main view,nan
