1459312341158792838,Fourseason  apartment  nile view snap /b2c336,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1459312341158792838?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1459312341158792838/original/c72cea87-580c-42b6-a872-00bfaf94ace1.jpeg,30.038,31.2329,4.8925321888412014,0.0,4.880128755364806,4.831845493562232,4.815214592274679,4.830793991416309,"3,881","3,881",0,"Discover a luxurious stay experience in the heart of Cairo in a private apartment within the Four Seasons Nile Plaza Hotel, where the hotel's distinctive luxury blends with the privacy of the home and the comfort of a quiet stay.Guests can enjoy the upscale Four Seasons atmosphere inside the residential tower, with 24/7 secure access, and premium services that provide the highest levels of tranquility and privacy. The location is excellent, minutes away from downtown, Garden City, and Zamalek, making it ideal for both business and leisure visitors.This apartment is an ideal choice for anyone looking for the elegance of the Four Seasons with the comfort of home",False,108,False,False,False,Nile view,nan
