1531939345241143002,ELITE/7BR Palace • VIP Stay • Palm Hills Golf Ex,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1531939345241143002?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1531939345241143002/original/23a36374-225d-4b04-8229-0e6559afe590.jpeg,29.99984367929904,31.034905661396134,4.8925321888412014,0.0,4.880128755364806,4.831845493562232,4.815214592274679,4.830793991416309,"3,039","3,039",0,"The Grand Golf Extension Palace, A Realm of Unparalleled LuxuryWelcome to an estate of extraordinary scale and sophistication, a magnificent 7-bedroom, 9-bathroom villa situated in the heart of the prestigious Palm Hills Golf Extension. This multi-level palace is a masterpiece of modern architecture and interior design, crafted to provide an unparalleled experience for large families, corporate delegations, or discerning groups seeking the pinnacle of luxury living.The spaceThe Grand Golf Extension Palace, A Realm of Unparalleled LuxuryWelcome to an estate of extraordinary scale and sophistication, a magnificent 7-bedroom, 9-bathroom villa situated in the heart of the prestigious Palm Hills Golf Extension. This multi-level palace is a masterpiece of modern architecture and interior design, crafted to provide an unparalleled experience for large families, corporate delegations, or discerning groups seeking the pinnacle of luxury living.Exterior & Arrival: A Statement of PrestigeThe villa makes a commanding first impression with its striking contemporary architecture, featuring clean geometric lines and a sophisticated color palette. A grand, modern wooden door serves as the main entrance, approached via elegant stone steps and flanked by tasteful landscaping. The property includes a private, paved driveway leading to a large covered carport, ensuring secure and discreet parking for multiple vehicles.Ground Floor: An Expansive World of Elegance and EntertainmentStep inside to a breathtaking, light-filled open-plan space that defines modern luxury. The entire ground floor is unified by pristine, polished marble flooring that gleams under a sophisticated lighting scheme of recessed lights and chic, modern chandeliers.Multiple Living Salons: This grand space is thoughtfully arranged into several distinct living areas. One zone is perfect for formal receptions, while another, centered around a large wall-mounted television, offers a more relaxed setting for family entertainment. The entire area is furnished with an exquisite collection of designer sofas, armchairs, and marble-topped coffee tables.Formal Dining Room: Set within the open-plan design is an elegant formal dining area. A stunning marble-topped table, surrounded by luxurious wood and fabric chairs and illuminated by a beautiful crystal chandelier, provides a perfect setting for memorable dinner parties.Seamless Indoor-Outdoor Flow: Expansive glass doors line the rear of the living area, opening directly onto the pool terrace and garden, flooding the space with natural light and creating a seamless connection to the beautiful outdoors.Outdoor Oasis: Your Exclusive Private ResortThe villa’s exterior grounds are a private paradise designed for leisure and relaxation.Private Swimming Pool: The centerpiece is a large, crystal-clear swimming pool, perfect for cooling off on a sunny day or enjoying a morning swim.Manicured Garden: The pool is surrounded by a spacious, manicured lawn and a paved sun terrace, offering ample room for sunbathing, recreation, and al fresco dining. The entire garden is enclosed by a tall, mature hedge, guaranteeing absolute privacy and tranquility.Accommodations & Private Living Quarters: A Multi-Level SanctuaryThis villa is uniquely designed with multiple levels of living space, providing unmatched comfort and privacy for large groups.Seven Luxurious Bedrooms: The estate boasts seven incredibly spacious bedrooms, most of which are designed as full master suites with private en-suite bathrooms. Each room is a sanctuary of comfort, featuring high-end modern furnishings, serene color palettes, ample wardrobe space, and individual air conditioning.Nine Exquisite Bathrooms: With nine bathrooms in total, the villa ensures ultimate convenience. Each bathroom is a work of art, from the opulent master bath adorned with shimmering gold mosaic tiles and a marble double vanity to the other sleek, modern bathrooms featuring walk-in showers, backlit mirrors, and designer fixtures.Dedicated Nanny's Suite: For families traveling with staff, a separate nanny's room with its own private bathroom is provided.Multiple Kitchens & Family Rooms: A standout feature of this grand villa is the inclusion of a main kitchen and at least two additional kitchenettes and family rooms on different floors. This thoughtful design allows different parts of a group to have their own private living and catering spaces, making it ideal for multi-generational families or corporate guests.Guest accessYou'll have exclusive access to the entire villa including all four bedrooms, the elegant reception areas, dining room, fully equipped kitchen, and the beautiful outdoor garden.The garden entertainment spaces, and all outdoor facilities are entirely at your disposal. Every space in this charming property has been designed for your comfort and enjoyment.Other things to noteTo maintain our prestigious property and ensure a wonderful experience for all:Maximum Guests allowed is Shown in the list (Additional fee is required for more Guests under exact conditions)Only registered guests may stay overnightCheck-in after 2:00 PM and check-out by 12:00 PMA valid ID or passport must be presented upon check-inPassport photos for all guests must be submitted before arrivalFor Arab passport holders, couples must submit an official marriage certificate. Visitors of the opposite sex are not allowed unless they're first degree relatives.A fully refundable security deposit of ONE NIGHT is required at check-inPets are not allowed (not even really cute ones) unless otherwise stated.Parties are prohibited (not even really quiet ones).Please be respectful of your neighbors and keep noise to a minimum from 10:00 Pm – 8:00 Am.Thank you for understanding and treating our home with the same care you would your own. We are dedicated to making your stay at One Of Our ELITE's a memorable experience of luxury and comfort.",False,859,False,True,False,balcony,nan
