1445646637252195144,4 Garden-view Rooms near to Ancient Wonders,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1445646637252195144?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1445646637252195144/original/a9825cdf-aa50-4548-afba-7a12e1975196.png,30.080555,30.905894,4.8925321888412014,0.0,4.880128755364806,4.831845493562232,4.815214592274679,4.830793991416309,"4,572","$5,468",-$895.20,"Ultimate escape in Cairo, just steps from the Great Pyramids—where mornings begin by the pool, afternoons unfold in the spa or on city tours, and evenings wind down with live music and cocktails. With family perks like a kids’ club and playground, plus top dining and nearby horseback rides, this resort blends comfort with a touch of wonder.The spaceThis listing is for 4 separate rooms within a hotel. The price shown in the listing covers all 4 rooms.✦ Each room is 258 sq. ft, equipped with complimentary toiletries, TV.✦ Rooms are not adjoining and possibly not next to each other. Spaces are assigned upon arrival based on availability.✦ Daily cleaning services included in the nightly price.There are a few additional details to know before you book:✦ The minimum age required for check-in is 18 years old.✦ Please ensure you have a valid ID for check-in, as it is mandatory for entry.Guest accessDuring your stay, you will have access to the property and amenities according to the following schedule:✦ Check-in is available from 2:00PM.✦ Fitness center is available.✦ Outdoor pool available all year.Other things to noteThere are several additional things to note:✦ Pets are not allowed.✦ We use multi-unit listings, so rooms are similar but may have small differences.✦ Self-parking is available (parking slot reservation is not required in advance) and costs USD 3.20 per day.✦ In Egypt, only married Egyptian couples are legally allowed to share the same hotel room.",False,240,False,True,False,"""Nile view""",nan
1533251126747083639,ELITE/5BR Villa • Ultra-Luxury • Green Heights,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1533251126747083639?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1533251126747083639/original/8b5f8881-2050-4e9f-bae5-ef28213cba13.jpeg,30.010864182328785,30.975093059644543,4.8925321888412014,0.0,4.880128755364806,4.831845493562232,4.815214592274679,4.830793991416309,"2,840","2,840",0,"🏡 Villa Compound Green Heights – Northern Heights, Sheikh Zayed Quiet, space, and real privacyIn one of the most serene and upscale areas of Sheikh Zayed, within the Green Heights Compound – Northern Heights, this villa offers a completely different feel from any traditional accommodation. Here the space is wide, the calm is real, and every corner of the villa is made to live in your comfort… not just to sit.From the moment you enter, you feel that the place is breathing comfortably. Natural light, open spaces, and smart distribution that gives everyone in the house their own space, and at the same time everyone is close to each other.The space1️⃣ Villa Components• The villa consists of two floors + roof • A very large garden surrounding the villa • Large private pool • Balcony on each floor + balcony on the ground floor • 5 bedrooms • Separate nanny room • 7 bathrooms with high-end finishes • 4 different living rooms (Each with a different feel and use) • Formal dining room • Fully equipped kitchen • Design that ensures privacy and ease of movement between floors2️. Special features (detailed human description)🌿 GardenThe garden here is a key element of the experience, not an addition. Large, open, and comfortable green space. It is useful for everything: A quiet morning, children's play, a family gathering, or even sitting alone with light music.🪑 Outdoor BaseA carefully crafted outdoor base in the garden Perfect for long stays, tea at night, or simple gatherings It feels very calm and private🏊‍♂️ Private PoolLarge swimming pool for the whole family Its space is comfortable, its design is practical, and its location guarantees privacy Fits a whole day of swimming and laughter Or even a quiet seat around the pool at sunset🌇 Balconies and RoofsA balcony on each floor gives you ventilation, light and a sense of spaciousness The roof is an open space for rest, air, and evening gatherings A perfect place to separate your brain from any pressure🛋️ Multiple living rooms4 living rooms, each with its own character A place for the family Guest place A place to calm down and a place for daily movement Smart distribution that serves large families without crowdingGuest access3️⃣ Villa Location📍 Green Heights Compound – Northern Heights, Sheikh ZayedOne of the finest and most prestigious compounds in Zayed High Privacy Aman Wide Streets Surrounded by villas onlyAt the same time, it is close to everything: • Minutes from 26th of July Axis • Close to Mall of Arabia • Close to Arkan Plaza • Minutes from Sheikh Zayed's best restaurants and cafes • Easy access to all areas of Zayed and 6th of OctoberThe equation here is clear: Quiet and comfortable… without isolation.Other things to note4️. Additional services at extra cost (VIP)• A worker who does all the housework (Cleaning – tidying – daily help with orders and housework)• Airport pick-up and drop-off • Cars with or without driver • Delivery of all household needs upon request5️⃣ Unit Rules• Check-in after 2:00 pm • Check out before 12:00 pm • Keep quiet after 11 pm • No parties • Provide ID or passport • A refundable deposit may be required • Number of guests as per prior agreement",False,540,False,True,False,"{'name': 'The main view or location feature (e.g., pyramids view, Nile view , city center, balcony with view) or any other view you find', 'description': None, 'value': None}",nan
