s location is thought out to give your hands the highest degree of privacy, whether it is a day recreation or a quiet night sitting - the experience is always sophisticated.🪑 Outdoor Base and Balconies• Outdoor base in the garden for long stays • Balconies on each floor with natural light and air • Spaces that let you enjoy the villa from the inside and outside at the same timeGuest access3️⃣ Villa Location📍 Royal City Compound – Sheikh Zayed• Hady and Raki Compound • Security and privacy • Surrounded by villas only • Perfect for families and those looking for real comfortAnd close to everything important:• Minutes from the main axes • Close to Mall of Arabia and Mall of Egypt • Close to Zayed's best restaurants and cafes • Easy access to the 26th of July axis • Convenient distance from Sphinx AirportThe perfect equation: Quiet + Space + Smart LocationOther things to note4️. Additional services at extra cost (VIP)• A worker who does all the housework (Cleaning – tidying – daily help with housework) • Airport pick-up and drop-off • Cars with or without driver • Delivery of all household needs upon request5️⃣ Unit Rules• Check-in after 2:00 pm • Check out before 12:00 pm • Keep quiet after 11 pm • No parties • Provide ID or passport • A refundable insurance may be required • Number of guests as per prior agreement • Respect the privacy of the place and the surroundings",False,508,False,True,False,"{""Royal City Compound""}",nan
