1512149212991607973,Lux 5BR Villa w/ Garden & Pool Palm Hills | 115,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1512149212991607973?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-11-02&check_out=2026-11-07,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTUxMjE0OTIxMjk5MTYwNzk3Mw==/original/11c45ba0-a212-4fe4-b776-05239ad3e56f.jpeg,30.00411139951748,31.04277558634422,4.8925321888412014,0.0,4.880128755364806,4.831845493562232,4.815214592274679,4.830793991416309,"2,640","$3,196",-$556.00,"Discover your perfect getaway at this exquisite 5-bedroom villa in Palm Hills, Sheikh Zayed. Fully furnished and designed for comfort and elegance, this retreat features a stunning private pool and a spacious garden—your very own oasis for relaxation and fun. With central A/C throughout, and family-friendly compound amenities like a children’s play area and pool, this villa is the ideal choice for families or groups looking for a luxurious stay.The spaceMaster Bedroom: Queen-size bed, en-suite bathroom, wardrobe, and air conditioning.Bedroom 2: Queen-size bed, dresser, wardrobe, and air conditioning.Bedroom 3: Queen-size bed, dresser, wardrobe, and air conditioning.Bedroom 4: Queen-size bed, dresser, wardrobe, and air conditioning.Bedroom 5: Two single beds, dresser, wardrobe, and air conditioning.Living Room: Two separate lounge areas, each with two couches and cozy chairs—perfect for relaxing or entertaining.Dining Area: Dining table with 6 chairs, ideal for family meals.Kitchen: Fully equipped with stove, oven, microwave, and two refrigerators.Bathrooms: 3 full bathrooms + 1 guest bathroom with modern fittings.Outdoor Space: Private swimming pool, large garden with outdoor seating.Perfect for families and groups!Guest accessGuests will have full access to the entire villa, including all bedrooms, bathrooms, living spaces, kitchen, dining area, private garden, and private pool. Within the compound, you can also enjoy the children’s play area and children’s pool. Parking is available on-site.Other things to noteRENTAL TERMS & CONDITIONSSecurity & DepositA fully refundable security deposit  is required at check-in.It will be refunded in full at check-out, provided no damage has occurred and all rules are respected.A valid ID or passport must be presented upon check-in. For every reservation, ID/passport photos for all guests must be submitted at least one day before arrival to issue entry permits.Property Use & ConductThe property is for residential use only.Guests must behave respectfully and not disturb neighbors or other residents.Noise must be kept low after 10:00 PM. Music or gatherings must not disturb the peace.Parties, large gatherings, and events are strictly prohibited without prior approval.Entry of individuals not included in the booking is strictly prohibited. Visitors are not allowed.Only registered guests may stay overnight.For Arab guests (including when only one member of the couple is Arab):Unmarried couples are not allowed.Mixed groups and male-only groups are not allowed.Proof of relationship (e.g., official marriage certificate) may be requested.Care of PropertyCharges will apply for any damage to the villa/apartment or its contents, including:Furniture, furnishings, glassware, and kitchen utensils.Excessive soiling of towels, bed linens, or pool water.All lights and air-conditioning units must be turned off when leaving the villa/apartment. You may request the housekeeper to pre-cool the unit before your return.Children in the pool must always be supervised by a responsible adult. Under no circumstances may children be left unattended.Check-in & Check-outCheck-in: From 2:00 PM (Cairo Local Time).Check-out: By 12:00 PM (Cairo Local Time).Late check-out may be available for an additional fee, subject to availability.Housekeeping & FeesAn obligatory housekeeping fee is applied at check-in/check-out:Apartment: 1,000 EGP per stay.Villa: 1,500 EGP per stay.This is a mandatory cleaning fee, not an optional service.Guests may request daily housekeeping during their stay for an additional fee (upon request).Additional ServicesCar rental starts from 2000 LE / night (upon request).Maid fee starts from 500 LE / night (upon request).",False,523,False,True,False,balcony,nan
