1403352409719548548,Nilefront 3BR–Steps fromTahrir Sq & Zamalek island,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1403352409719548548?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1403352409719548548/original/7cd41062-5e92-4d80-b4b3-897262f6bfd4.jpeg,30.0519,31.2309,4.64,36.0,4.56,4.39,4.5,4.69,"1,326","1,326",0,"Iconic 3BR with stunning panoramic views of the Nile, Zamalek Island, Nile boats & Gezira Club. Steps from Tahrir Square & Egyptian Museum. Stylish space with 3 bedrooms, 2 baths, full kitchen, dining for 6 & spacious living room with direct Nile views. Surrounded by top 5-star hotels: Ramses Hilton, Ritz-Carlton & St. Regis. Natural indoor trees & cozy, airy vibes. AC (hot/could), Wi-Fi & smart TV. Luxury, comfort & location in one perfect stay!A true Cairo gem!The space🎉Stylish 3-Bedroom Apartment with Breathtaking Nile & Zamalek Views🎉✔ Wake up to one of the most iconic views in Cairo stretching across the legendary Nile River, Zamalek Island, and the lush Gezira Sporting Club. 🚿  This elegant 3-bedroom apartment combines luxury, comfort, and unbeatable location in the heart of the city.🏡 Whether you’re relaxing in the spacious living room, dining with friends as the sun sets over the water, or enjoying a peaceful night’s sleep, this space is designed to offer a serene and memorable experience.✔ 3 comfortable bedrooms (sleeps up to 6)✔ 🌆Full Nile and Zamalek island views✔ 🛋 Bright open living and dining areas with large windows✔🍳 Fully equipped kitchen✔🛏2 modern bathrooms✔🏢 Stylish decor with warm, natural touches✔✨ A secure building with two elevatorsSteps from Tahrir Square, the Egyptian Museum, and surrounded by top hotels and restaurants this apartment offers the perfect mix of convenience, luxury, and iconic scenery.✅  Ideal for families, business travelers, or friends seeking a unique Cairo stay with a view to remember.Guest accessYou will have the whole space to yourself nothing is being shared nothing is off limits.Other things to noteAll Kind of transportation are available also you can download London Cap or Uber app to order a car to your door! always available and cheap.🏜️🐫 Attractions to Visit:📍 Egyptian Museum – Just a 5 -minute walk, showcasing ancient artifacts and treasures.📍 Tahrir Square – The heart of Cairo's history and culture.📍 The apatment overlooking Mamsha Ahl Masr – A scenic promenade along the Nile, perfect for evening strolls.📍 Cairo Opera House – Experience world-class performances and cultural events.📍 Khan El Khalili Bazaar – A vibrant marketplace for souvenirs, spices, and handcrafted treasures.🌟 Book your stay today and experience Cairo in style! 🌟Secure your dates now and make unforgettable memories in one of Cairo’s most sought-after locations!",True,381,True,False,False,The main view of the Nile River stretching across Zamalek Island,nan
1416404953594448126,Elegant 4BR Apartment Full Nile View & Modern Vibe,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1416404953594448126?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTQxNjQwNDk1MzU5NDQ0ODEyNg==/original/6546dee3-e564-42d1-96ff-d7ee1981ca41.jpeg,30.0207,31.2177,5.0,43.0,4.91,5.0,4.81,4.91,"1,386","1,386",0,"Experience stunning Nile views from this elegant 4-bedroom waterfront apartment in the heart of vibrant Cairo. This refined retreat comfortably fits groups and families, offering panoramic river scenery from its floor-to-ceiling windows.Its prime location is moments from iconic landmarks and luxury hotels, providing the perfect base for exploring the city. Enjoy modern comforts and a dedicated dining area in this unique urban oasis.The spaceStep into a bright, refined interior that blends modern aesthetics with ultimate comfort. The open-plan living space features floor-to-ceiling windows, allowing you to relax on contemporary sofas while taking in panoramic views of the Nile River. A dedicated dining area, also overlooking the water, is ideal for sharing meals and creating memories.This apartment is thoughtfully appointed to ensure a seamless stay:  • Bedrooms: Four spacious bedrooms await, furnished with comfortable beds and fresh linens. Two of the bedrooms feature direct Nile views, perfect for waking up to peaceful mornings and enjoying stunning sunsets.• Bathrooms: You'll have access to two full, modern bathrooms, one of which includes a luxurious walk-in rain shower.• Kitchen: The sleek, fully equipped kitchen has all the essentials needed for cooking and dining at home, featuring modern appliances and ample counter space.• Key Amenities: Enjoy complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, full air conditioning, an in-unit washing machine, and a TV for your entertainment.Guest accessYou will have private and exclusive access to the entire apartment during your stay.Other things to noteWe look forward to hosting you for an unforgettable stay on the Nile! Please feel free to reach out with any questions you may have before or during your visit.",True,263,True,False,False,Nile,nan
1583383730365544848,Casa Royal/Zamalek Nile Loft,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1583383730365544848?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-12&check_out=2026-05-17,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1583383730365544848/original/60300340-43a7-4912-ad55-68118d7d3821.jpeg,30.05483,31.21758,4.94,18.0,4.89,4.89,4.83,4.83,"1,340","1,340",0,"Welcome to Casa Royal. Your serene home in the heart of Zamalek. This Art Deco–inspired home opens onto a huge terrace where the Nile and city skyline feel close enough to touch. Inside, three serene bedrooms with Egyptian-cotton sheets and memory-foam mattresses invite deep, unbroken rest every night. The sunlit living room, with its 55” smart TV and wide windows, gathers everyone around a view that feels like a living painting, quiet yet full of energy and soft golden light, day and night.The spaceThis Zamalek apartment is built around its huge terrace, where you can sit so close to the beautiful Nile river and watch boats and city lights drift slowly by in the breeze. Inside are three calm bedrooms with Egyptian-cotton bedding and memory-foam mattresses that gently hold you as you sleep and wake each day. The living room has a 55” smart TV, Art Deco touches and a wide, open view, so even the quietest nights at home feel warm, cinematic and peacefully bright.",True,166,False,False,False,"{""Nile""}",nan
