1577988958474149016,Alsawah | 5BR Luxurious Palace w/Pool & Garden,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1577988958474149016?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/miso/Hosting-1200337074280025271/original/036a7a4e-7e45-4fc3-9646-e092834d317f.jpeg,30.082336682978188,30.98538409225569,4.8925321888412014,0.0,4.880128755364806,4.831845493562232,4.815214592274679,4.830793991416309,"3,130","3,130",0,"Discover refined luxury in this exquisite 5-bedroom palace located in Sheikh Zayed’s prestigious Green Revolution. The villa features 5 spacious master bedrooms, 7 elegant bathrooms, and beautifully designed interiors with high-end finishes. Enjoy complete privacy with a private swimming pool and a large lush garden, ideal for relaxation and entertaining. One of the finest luxury palaces in Sheikh Zayed, perfect for families, special gatherings, or an unforgettable premium stay.The spaceProperty Type: Luxury VillaBedrooms: 5 (All with ensuite bathrooms)Bathrooms: 7 (5 ensuite + 2 guest)Size: 1800 square metersSpecial Features: Private swimming pool, expansive garden, outdoor majlis seating area, Private Outdoors Seating.We've curated every detail to create an extraordinary experience, from the custom designer furniture and premium finishes to the resort-style pool and lush landscaped gardens that transform this property into your private sanctuary.Alsawah Palace is situated in Revolution Heights, one of the area's most exclusive gated communities known for its spacious estates and impeccable security.Guest access“Enjoy full privacy with exclusive access to the entire residence.”",False,164,False,True,False,balcony,nan
1338161607315089684,Luxury Living with Full Nile Views: 4BR Gem,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1338161607315089684?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/miso/Hosting-1338161607315089684/original/e50346a5-df98-44c5-9031-a3a8cfdb7b10.jpeg,30.0699,31.2271,4.96,51.0,4.96,4.96,4.86,4.92,"1,386","1,386",0,"Welcome to your luxurious Nile-front retreat, located in the heart of Cairo! This elegantly designed and furnished apartment offers breathtaking full Nile views.The apartment is in a prime location, directly across from People Of Egypt Walkway ** ممشى أهل مصر**, Cairo's vibrant riverside walkway. You’ll also find yourself next to the prestigious Fairmont Nile City Hotel and within walking distance of iconic landmarks like the St. Regis Hotel and Conrad Cairo Hotel.The spaceSpacious and comfortable 4-bedroom apartment (1 master bedroom and 3 additional rooms) featuring 2 main bathrooms, 1 guest bathroom, and a separate utility room bathroom, fully equipped with all the amenities you need.The apartment offers generous living space with high-end, luxurious furnishings throughout. The bright living and dining areas flow into a uniquely designed open kitchen, all set alongside beautiful views of the Nile River.Guest accessEntire Apartment",True,139,False,False,False,Nile view,nan
