1471185594805842352,Luxury Flat w/ Nile River Views,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1471185594805842352?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-03&check_out=2026-05-08,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1471185594805842352/original/1ee74324-5f2c-463a-8d6f-84870a9c4959.jpeg,30.066082475759583,31.221082776058037,5.0,17.0,4.88,4.94,4.88,5.0,"1,318","1,318",0,"Located in Zamalek,  the newly renovated flat boasts unforgettable views of the Nile, 3 bedrooms / 3 bathrooms and is adorned w/ elegant furniture and décor. It features a formal living room and dining room and a more casual sitting room (with games, foosball, and a TV). The flat is 210 sqm (2,300 sqft) and has a home office, a laundry room (w/ W & D) and a modern chef’s kitchen. Ideal for a family or shared with friends, the flat comfortably sleeps 6 guests.The spaceWelcome to the luxury flat in Zamalek, one of Cairo’s finest neighborhoods. The historic district of Zamalek occupies an island in the middle of the Nile. The entire flat is available for short-term and long-term rental. The freshly-renovated flat is the perfect retreat away from the hustle and bustle of Cairo, w/ Zamalek brimming with trendy restaurants/bars/coffee houses, chic art galleries, antique stores and stylish boutiques. Many embassies call this neighborhood home.Tastefully appointed, the breathtaking view of the Nile is only one of the reasons to make this flat your home during your stay in Cairo.   3 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms:-- Ensuite primary / master bedroom with a private bath offers lots of space, and a “king”-size bed with 300-thread     count Egyptian cotton bedding. -- 2 additional bedrooms,  with 2 beds in each room, are perfect for children or to share with friends-- Shared balcony -- Each bedroom has spacious armoire closets.3 bathrooms:-- Bathtub and a toddler commode = modern-day conveniences for guests with young children-- Bathrooms are fully stocked with fresh “loufa”, and locally-sourced shampoo / conditioner and body wash.Fully-equipped modern, European-style kitchen with:-- Gas stove and oven for cooking (and a separate electric oven for baking)-- Built-in refrigerator, microwave and dishwasher-- Filtered water for your health and safetyDining room can accommodate 6 comfortably, perfect for entertaining or family meals.Bar / counter can accommodate 3 or 4 more for breakfast, lunch or dinner.  Two separate sitting areas:--The more formal sitting area is luxuriously furnished with designer-selected pieces and a breathtaking view of the Nile.  --The casual sitting area (with the same views) is adjacent to a separate kids’ entertainment area (television, board games, a Real Madrid FCB-themed foosball table, books, magnetic darts and other activities to keep your younger guests entertained.Dedicated workspace with a Brother printer/scanner/copier, making it convenient to work from “home” or check in with the office while on vacation.  Reliable Wi-Fi will keep you connected throughout the apartment. Laundry room with new washer and dryer+eco / environmental, hypoallergenic detergent+clothes line,+iron / tableConvenient for those traveling for days or weeks. Equipped with 8 separate carrier AC units for individualized cooling, essential for hot, humid summers in Egypt.  (Alternatively, these can be used for individualized heating in the winter, as well.)  Fire extinguisher + smoke detector + carbon-monoxide detector =  safetyThis home is located in a secure, doorman-serviced residential building, one street off the Nile River. For those of you brave enough to drive in Cairo, parking is available on-site with a valet / parking attendant. A small elevator is also available for your convenience.Zamalek is a very walkable neighborhood! --The Khalil Museum (private collection of impressionist and modern art housed in a historic villa) is not too far away.--The Marriott and Harry’s Bar is about a 15-minute walk, and the underground (subway) is less than a 10-minute walk from the apartment, providing greater access to the rest of Cairo.BY CAR--Cairo Int’l Airport is less than 1 hour away.--Ramses (main) train station is about 20 minutes away.--Coptic (Old Cairo) is about 45 minutes away and historic Coptic monasteries are about 2 hours away.--Mohammed Ali mosque is about 45 minutes away.Guest accessThe apartment is available to the guests in its entirety.  The host's representative will greet guests upon arrival.  Located in a secure, doorman-serviced residential building, one street off the Nile River.   For those of you brave enough to drive in Cairo, parking is available on-site with a valet / parking attendant. A small elevator is also available for your convenience.Other things to noteThe nightly rate increases due to the required 14% Egyptian VAT.A passport for each guest is required before check-in.",True,688,True,False,False,Nile,nan
1231653058739693540,Luxurious 3BR Apartment with Stunning Nile Views,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1231653058739693540?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTIzMTY1MzA1ODczOTY5MzU0MA==/original/4bb85059-cb33-4907-9b8f-b56f98910592.jpeg,30.01916,31.21713,4.95,62.0,4.95,4.87,4.94,4.87,"1,235","1,235",0,"Experience the epitome of luxury with breathtaking, full Nile views in the heart of Egypt! This chic luxury apartment offers stunning vistas of the iconic river while being conveniently located near renowned attractions like the Pyramids, the Sphinx, and the Egyptian Museum as well as surrounded by prestigious hotels such as the Four Seasons. The apartment’s contemporary interior design offers a serene and stylish ambiance, perfect for a relaxing and comfortable stay.The spaceComfortable 3 Bedrooms (1 Master Bedroom and 2 Rooms) with 2 main bathrooms and 1 guest bathroom with all the amenities you need included.The apartment has all high-end luxurious furniture with the living room and dining fully by the beautiful Nile River.Guest accessEntire Apartment",True,116,False,False,False,$,nan
1606000121406098996,Bayt Abbas Experience - The Grand Egyptian Museum,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1606000121406098996?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1606000121406098996/original/77e0bc6f-ded3-4f31-a9c3-5dd5de7a2686.jpeg,30.0037,31.1126,5.0,1.0,5.0,4.0,5.0,5.0,"1,404","1,404",0,"Bayt Abbas is a peaceful boutique stay inspired by the warmth of an Egyptian home. It’s designed for travelers who value calm vibes, authenticity, and meaningful experiences over hotel-style stays. With three thoughtfully designed bedrooms and inviting shared areas, the space encourages guests to slow down and enjoy a more human, local experience close to Cairo’s iconic landmarks.The spaceThe property includes three comfortable bedrooms, each designed with character and attention to detail, along with shared outdoor and communal spaces that reflect the calm and homey spirit of Bayt Abbas. Every corner is created to feel welcoming, relaxed, and connected to the surrounding environment.Guest accessGuests have access to their private bedrooms and all shared areas within Bayt Abbas, including the decks, dine & chill area, rooftop, pool, and jacuzzi. Shared areas may also be used by the on-site caretaker and Bayt Abbas staff as part of daily operations, while always respecting guests’ privacy.Other things to noteBayt Abbas is a boutique accommodation, not a hotel, and is designed to be calm and peaceful. Shared spaces are intended for respectful, quiet use. The property is ideal for couples, families, and travelers looking for an authentic and relaxed local experience.To our Egyptian and Arab brothers and sisters:To ensure compliance with the house rules and local regulations of the Ministry of Interior, mixed-gender accommodation and visits are permitted only for married couples or first-degree relatives.Therefore, prior to your arrival, please provide us with an official document proving your family relationship or marriage.If the required document is not provided or if the booking details do not comply with these terms, we may, unfortunately, be forced to cancel the booking before or upon arrival and vacate the unit immediately without any refund, and we will notify the relevant authorities in accordance with the applicable regulations.We appreciate your understanding and cooperation, and we look forward to hosting you and providing you with a comfortable stay.",True,317,False,True,False,balcony,nan
