1367296864393571550,Whispers Of The Nile I Nesty Hospitality,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1367296864393571550?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-13&check_out=2026-05-18,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTM2NzI5Njg2NDM5MzU3MTU1MA==/original/b1ffb258-b8e5-4eff-b7bb-5e1a44f62f6d.jpeg,30.0665,31.2161,4.92,36.0,4.89,4.94,4.56,4.89,886,886,0,"Welcome to Your Dream Escape in Zamalek!**Step into your personal paradise at our newly renovated apartment on Abul Feda Street, where modern comfort meets the enchanting charm of Old Cairo.The spaceAs you enter this tranquil retreat, you’ll be greeted by panoramic views of the majestic Nile River from the master bedroom. Picture yourself waking up to the soft glow of the sunrise, casting a golden hue across the water, or unwinding at sunset as the sky blushes with vibrant colors, all from the serenity of your bed.The apartment features a cozy window seating area with stunning views of the Nile and the bustling streets of Cairo. Imagine sipping your morning coffee or curling up with a good book as you gaze out at the ever-changing tapestry of life along the river. This serene nook invites you to relax and soak in the beauty of your surroundings.Every corner of our apartment has been thoughtfully designed with modern furnishings and a cozy atmosphere, ensuring a peaceful and enjoyable stay. You’ll find everything you need at your fingertips, whether you're here for a leisurely getaway or a crucial business trip. Zamalek is teeming with life, and you’ll have easy access to shopping, local markets, and a plethora of dining options that celebrate the diverse flavors of Cairo’s culinary scene.Right in front of the apartment building, you'll discover convenient Nile boat and kayak rentals. Explore the scenic banks of the Nile while immersing yourself in the vibrant culture of the area. Whether you prefer a calming paddle on the water or a picturesque cruise, there's no better way to experience the heart of Cairo than from the river.But what truly sets us apart is our commitment to exceptional hospitality. Our dedicated team is passionate about providing personalized service, ensuring that your experience with us is seamless from the moment you make your reservation until the day you depart. We believe that every guest deserves a unique and memorable stay, and we're here to make that happen.Come and immerse yourself in the vibrant culture and warm spirit of Cairo. Whether you seek adventure or relaxation, your perfect home away from home awaits. We can’t wait to welcome you!Guest accessEntire SpaceOther things to noteCan't get enough of great views? You'll love our bedroom, with the Nile on one side and the streets of Cairo on the other✨To our Egyptian and Arab brothers and sisters:To ensure compliance with the building management's instructions and the local regulations of the Ministry of Interior, mixed-gender stays and visits are permitted only for married couples or first-degree relatives.Therefore, prior to your arrival, please provide us with an official document proving your family relationship or marriage.If the required document is not provided or if the booking details do not comply with these terms, we may, unfortunately, be forced to cancel the booking before or upon arrival and vacate the unit immediately without any refund, and we will notify the relevant authorities in accordance with the applicable regulations.We appreciate your understanding and cooperation, and we look forward to hosting you and providing you with a comfortable stay.",True,514,False,False,False,"{""name"": ""Nile View"", ""description"": ""A stunning view of the Nile River from your bedroom""}",nan
