1498754373289779521,The Grand Tree House I Nesty Hospitality,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1498754373289779521?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-05&check_out=2026-05-10,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1498754373289779521/original/1a334108-6092-4f40-825b-ddeff9ebad69.jpeg,30.0664,31.2199,4.97,32.0,4.94,4.94,4.84,4.91,804,804,0,"Welcome to Your Chic Zamalek Retreat by the Dancing TreeNestled in the heart of Zamalek on historic Taha Hussein Street, this freshly refurbished apartment offers the perfect blend of comfort, design, and location. Thoughtfully renovated with a sleek contemporary touch, the space is furnished with unique pieces that make it stand out, while still feeling like a home away from home.The spaceyou’ll immediately feel it — the calm of Zamalek’s leafy charm blending with the elegance of a freshly refurbished home. The first thing you’ll notice is the sense of space and light. Each corner of the apartment was carefully designed during its recent renovation, combining sleek finishes with one-of-a-kind furniture pieces that make the apartment both modern and full of character.  The layout flows beautifully. Two large bedrooms offer comfort and privacy, with the master bedroom boasting its own en-suite bathroom. The living area was designed for lingering — a chic sofa that invites you to sink in, a piano waiting for a quiet melody, and a large screen TV for slow evenings. Just beside it, the stylish dining table sets the stage for lively meals, whether you’re cooking at home or bringing in local delicacies.  Morning light pours onto the terrace, where a majestic tree — lovingly called the “dancing tree” — stretches wide, creating a natural canopy of shade. It’s the perfect place to sip your coffee, read a book, or simply watch life in Zamalek flow by.  The heart of the home is the American kitchen: modern, fully loaded, and ready for anything from a quick cup of coffee to a dinner with friends. Every detail has been thought through to make your stay seamless and comfortable.  Step outside, and you’re immersed in Zamalek’s unique rhythm. Cafés, bakeries, and local eateries line the nearby streets. Art galleries, boutique shops, and cultural centers are just around the corner. The Nile Corniche is a stroll away for sunset walks, while supermarkets, pharmacies, and practical essentials are all within easy reach.  This apartment isn’t just a place to stay — it’s your stylish sanctuary in the heart of Cairo. Whether you’re here to explore, work, or unwind, you’ll find yourself returning each day to a home that feels both inspiring and comforting, always under the gentle shade of the dancing tree.Other things to noteStart your stay off right! We offer a premium airport transfer at a great value, along with handpicked local recommendations so you can enjoy your stay like a local from day one. We're always here to help✨To our Egyptian and Arab brothers and sisters:To ensure compliance with the house rules and local regulations of the Ministry of Interior, mixed-gender accommodation and visits are permitted only for married couples or first-degree relatives.Therefore, prior to your arrival, please provide us with an official document proving your family relationship or marriage.If the required document is not provided or if the booking details do not comply with these terms, we may, unfortunately, be forced to cancel the booking before or upon arrival and vacate the unit immediately without any refund, and we will notify the relevant authorities in accordance with the applicable regulations.We appreciate your understanding and cooperation, and we look forward to hosting you and providing you with a comfortable stay.",True,542,False,False,False,Nile Corniche,nan
