1503583342792353981,Spacious 450 sqm 3-BR + Maid’s Room |Prime View|SP,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1503583342792353981?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1503583342792353981/original/888ef15c-2401-4eb0-a5e4-831b07aaacf1.jpeg,30.048,31.4762,4.79,33.0,4.79,4.79,4.82,4.73,745,745,0,"Experience unmatched luxury in this extraordinary 450 sqm apartment at Silver Palm Compound, New Cairo.This expansive residence features three grand bedrooms, a nanny’s room, and a private balcony overlooking the pool, garden, and fountain. Designed with premium finishes, it offers a spacious living area, a full billiard table, and a large fully equipped kitchen. Perfectly located just steps from the compound’s vibrant strip mall (O1) with top restaurants, gyms, and all daily conveniences.The spaceKITCHENA spacious, fully enclosed kitchen designed for both daily use and entertaining. It is exceptionally large and fully equipped with every essential appliance and utensil, including an oven, full-sized refrigerator, microwave, toaster, kettle, dishwasher, and washing machine.. ensuring a complete and seamless cooking experience.⸻LIVING AREAAn expansive and stylish living area offering the perfect balance of comfort and entertainment. The space features a large, comfortable sofa, a 60-inch Smart TV, and a full billiard table, making it ideal for family gatherings or relaxation. The elegant marble flooring adds a refined touch throughout the home.⸻BEDROOMSThis luxurious apartment includes four bedrooms.. three main suites and a nanny’s room.. each with its own private bathroom for maximum privacy and comfort.• The first master bedroom features a king-size bed (180 × 200 cm) and a dedicated dressing area.• The second bedroom includes two single beds (120 × 200 cm each).• The third bedroom offers a king-size bed (180 × 200 cm).• The fourth is a nanny’s room with its own private bathroom.All rooms are elegantly designed with built-in wardrobes and fine finishes.⸻BATHROOMSThe apartment offers a total of five bathrooms.. four en-suite and one additional guest bathroom. Each bathroom features high-quality marble finishes, a modern walk-in shower, and premium amenities such as fresh towels, shampoo, and soap for a luxurious stay.⸻BALCONYA large balcony with elegant outdoor seating overlooking the swimming pool, lush gardens, and the central fountain.. perfect for morning coffee or relaxing evenings.⸻ADDITIONAL AMENITIESCentral air-conditioning, high-speed Wi-Fi, Netflix, and TOD access for live sports streaming are all included. Every corner of this 450 sqm residence reflects superior craftsmanship and luxury, designed to offer space, elegance, and comfort at the highest level.Guest accessAs a guest, you’ll enjoy full access to the compound’s premium facilities, designed for comfort, leisure, and convenience.You have access to a spacious pedestrian walkway that surrounds the fountain and beautifully landscaped gardens throughout the compound.Just a one-minute walk away lies O1 Mall, one of New Cairo’s most vibrant destinations, offering:A wide variety of restaurants and cafés, a central courtyard adorned with water features, trees, and flowers, a children’s play area, and a fully equipped gym (available for an additional fee of approximately USD 12 per person, valid for single use).You’ll also find a medical center, pharmacy, bank, post office, currency exchange, secure parking, and free Wi-Fi throughout the area.⸻Nearby AttractionsO1 Mall: 1 minuteGarden 8 Mall: 10 minutesDistrict 5 Mall: 15 minutesCairo Festival City Mall (CFC): 15 minutes5A Mall: 20 minutesCairo International Airport: 20 minutesDowntown Cairo: 45 minutesGrand Egyptian Museum: 45 minutesOther things to noteImportant note 🚨There may be some finishing work that could cause minor noise from Sunday to Wednesday, between 9:30 AM and 3:30 PM.Please note that this unit is located on the second floor.The neighboring units on the same floor are still under finishing.Once you have booked and received the confirmation email, to ensure a smooth check in we kindly ask you to provide a clear and complete photo of your passport is required. These procedures are specific to the compound in order to issue your entry permit.Thank you for your understanding.The cleaning fees mentioned in the price breakdown cover only the check out cleaning. For any additional in-stay cleaning, please reach out to us for prices and bookings.Additional ServicesAn extra folding bed can be provided upon request; however, it is not the same as the main bed and may offer less comfort.A baby crib, a child’s long chair, and additional towels can also be arranged.All of these items must be requested in advance at least 5 days before arrival to ensure availability.Please note that additional charges apply for these services.",True,673,True,True,False,,nan
1424519240566200741,VESTA - Luxury 6BR Pool Villa - New Cairo,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1424519240566200741?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-1424519240566200741/original/d4f2e19f-2401-4098-a512-2a127ad30a83.jpeg,30.0071,31.4817,4.81,16.0,5.0,4.88,4.88,4.88,"1,571","1,571",0,"Luxurious Villa located in New Cairo, Cairo. A very fresh theme in the heart of New Cairo. Complimentary housekeeping is provided on the 7th day for stays of a full week. Additional housekeeping can be arranged via Airbnb messaging for an extra fee. Netflix and free Wi-Fi.The spaceVilla Specs: 6BR, 3 Bathrooms, Full Kitchen, Reception, Dining Room.Amenities:- Wi-Fi (20GB max per day)- Netflix, AC, Private Parking- Pets accepted under request (depends on the breed) Instructions:- For any reservation, a photo for every passport for everyone who will be checking in should be provided at least one day before arrival day so we can provide them entry permits.- For any reservation confirmed same day of arrival, guest will be requested to send a photo for each passport for all the guests who will be checking in before 3 pm Cairo Local time,so, we can provide them entry permits, otherwise guest will not be able to enter the residential compound where this unit is located.- Online Payment is required 7 days before arrival to avoid automated cancellation- Guest will be requested to sign an online registration card upon arrival - Location and Keylock box code will be sent to the guest same day of check-in once payment is confirmed - Check-in from 03.00 PM to 08.00 PM- Check out is at 12.00 PM- No late check out is permitted - No early check in is permitted- Guest will be asked to provide an insurance deposit 300 USD that will be held from his credit card - Unmarried couples and mixed groups are not allowed- Proof of relation may be asked to be provided to us (example: Marriage Certificate) - Visitors are not allowed