913438781106788261,Serene New Cairo Villa | Pool & Stylish Living,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/913438781106788261?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-08&check_out=2026-05-13,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-913438781106788261/original/ea3c2237-a2a9-4e43-8b5c-ac7730620ca3.jpeg,30.0233,31.4877,5.0,31.0,4.97,4.9,4.94,4.97,"1,232","1,232",0,"Welcome to your home away from home! This modern, serene house is designed for comfort and relaxation. Step outside and enjoy the refreshing pool.You’ll find a fully equipped kitchen with everything you need to cook your favourite meals.The home is centrally located in New Cairo, with supermarkets, cinemas, and plenty of entertainment options nearby.Whether you’re here for business, leisure, or a mix of both, this cozy modern space is the perfect base for your stay. You’ll absolutely ❤️ it.The spaceEscape to a modern villa designed for comfort, privacy, and convenience. Relax in your own private swimming pool, fully enclosed within the garden for complete seclusion. Located in the prestigious Moon Valley 1 Compound on Street 90, you’ll be just steps away from Gold’s Gym, Concord Plaza, Point 90 Mall, the American University in Cairo, top supermarkets, and countless dining and entertainment options. With the Ring Road easily accessible, you’re only 20 minutes from Cairo Airport and have quick access to downtown, Ain Sokhna, and Sinai.Inside, the villa spans three floors with 4 dining areas, 4 bedrooms, and space for up to 7 guests. Enjoy speedy WiFi on every floor, a dedicated office, multiple bathrooms, and a culinary-ready kitchen for food lovers. An elevator inside the villa adds extra comfort.Guests can also enjoy paddle courts, football courts, and a public pool within the compound. Deliveries are fast, and you’ll always feel connected while still escaping the city’s hustle.As your hosts, we welcome you from the heart ❤️. Need an airport pickup, a private driver, or even an in-house manicurist? We can make it happen. Your perfect Cairo stay starts here.We provide a cleaning service upon request Complimentary toiletries Breakfast (extra charge)Elevator - the villa has an elevator that serves all 3 floors. Elevator use is upon request and approval from the host. It is for 20 USD per day to be paid in advance prior to check in and a damage  deposit of 400 usd to be placed in the lockbox upon arrival. Usage of the elevator is not included in the listing rate. We provide a cleaning service upon request Complimentary tea and coffee and mineral water  provided. Complimentary toiletries Ask for our amazing Breakfast Options  (extra charge)Guest accessEnjoy the full privacy of the villa — the entire house and garden are included in your stay and are exclusively yours. No shared spaces, no interruptions — just complete comfort and freedom to relax, swim, and unwind in total seclusion.Other things to noteOur villa offers a fully gated private garden and swimming pool, giving you total privacy and peace of mind. Inside, you’ll even find a private elevator for extra comfort and convenience — a rare luxury in a home setting!The compound itself is quiet, secure, and strictly residential, ensuring a calm and relaxing atmosphere away from the city’s noise. With 24/7 security, you can truly unwind and enjoy your stay.✨ Bonus: You’ll also love how easy deliveries arrive at your doorstep, plus the friendly community feel that makes every guest feel at home.",True,503,True,True,False,,nan
