1094737973419244719,The Nile Vintage Haven,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1094737973419244719?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-06&check_out=2026-05-11,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTA5NDczNzk3MzQxOTI0NDcxOQ%3D%3D/original/33704f55-edb5-4cec-89a2-0c362ff1950c.jpeg,30.0537,31.2183,4.86,73.0,4.89,4.84,4.81,4.92,"1,098","1,098",0,"Welcome to our vintage Nile GEM in the upscaled area of South Zamalek , a charming retreat with a panoramic Nile view, ample light and sun in the heart of Cairo that caters to all travelers - whether you're a couple, family, friends, or a solo adventurer. The apartment boasts brand new furniture and eclectic decor, perfect for lounging on the couch or savoring your morning coffee with a breathtaking Nile view and a glimpse of the majestic Pyramids.The spaceFor our working travelers, we've got you covered with few workspaces’ spots throughout the apartment. Our building features a striking white marble facade, 24-hour security, and a welcoming front desk. The NILE skyline, situated on the 12th floor, offers a unique 360-degree view of Cairo and its bustling streets, along with iconic landmarks.Within a few minutes’ walk, you'll find yourself amidst vibrant markets, trendy hangouts, and Cairo's famous landmarks, including Taher Square, the Egyptian Museum, Fish Garden, and traditional flea markets. Our meticulously decorated Nile gem exudes Egyptian charm, providing a cultural backdrop to your stay.Step outside and indulge in the local scene - across the street, The Nile awaits with its modern hangout hub, offering everything from dining to coffee to entertainment. Relax in the hammock chair, soak in the atmosphere, or whip up a meal in our fully equipped kitchen. Take a peek at our reviews to discover what guests have loved about their experience staying with us. Your Cairo adventure begins here with a memorable stay!Guest accessThe entire beautiful flat :)Other things to noteTo Ensure a smooth experience and check in, we offer our premium ride at a very reasonable cost to pick you & drop you to the airport.To hit the floor running we will be sharing with your our local recommendations and we are here to help.Ask us any questions and we will be happy to make your trip exceptional :)For Egyptian and Arab guests:To comply with building management instructions and local regulations, mixed stays and visits are permitted only for married couples or first-degree relatives.Therefore, kindly provide an official document confirming the relationship or marriage before arrival.If the required document is not provided, or if the booking details do not comply with these conditions, we may unfortunately need to cancel the reservation before or upon arrival and request immediate check-out without any refund. The relevant authorities may also be notified in accordance with the applicable regulations. Thank you for your understanding and cooperation.",True,408,False,False,False,The main view,nan
