1436654490966779045,The Vintage Sunshine I Nesty Hospitality,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1436654490966779045?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1436654490966779045/original/33fa992f-e7a7-423b-a5e8-f1cb3b713e3b.jpeg,30.0644,31.2169,4.84,45.0,4.93,4.82,4.8,4.84,929,929,0,"Welcome to our charming apartment in a historic Zamalek building, blending vintage elegance with modern comfort. Featuring high ceilings, three stylish bedrooms (one en-suite), and plenty of natural light, it's ideal for travelers seeking space and charm. Recently renovated by The Red Door design team, the apartment preserves its heritage while offering modern amenities. Located just steps from the Nile, nearby restaurants, cafes, and the vibrant Five Bells bar.The spaceThe apartment features three beautifully designed bedrooms, including a spacious en-suite with a private attached bathroom, ensuring comfort and privacy for your stay. Newly refurbished by our boutique design team at The Red Door, we’ve preserved its heritage style while providing everything you need for a memorable experience.Ideal for both relaxation and exploration, our apartment is just a minute's walk from the picturesque Nile and mere steps away from a vibrant array of retail and commercial hotspots, including delightful restaurants, bars, and coffee shops. You can easily stroll to the renowned Five Bells restaurant and bar, a gathering place for artists and actors.As you step into this heritage building, recognized as a historical gem of Cairo, you will sense its unique energy and charm. Whether you’re visiting for leisure or work, our home promises a comfortable, spacious stay in the heart of Zamalek.Enjoy your experience and discover the perfect blend of vintage elegance and modern convenience!Guest accessEntire placeOther things to noteLet your vacation begin the moment you arrive! We offer a comfortable airport transfer and will send you our top local recommendations to make your stay unforgettable. We're just a message away anytime✨To our Egyptian and Arab brothers and sisters:To ensure compliance with the building management's instructions and the local regulations of the Ministry of Interior, mixed-gender stays and visits are permitted only for married couples or first-degree relatives.Therefore, prior to your arrival, please provide us with an official document proving your family relationship or marriage.If the required document is not provided or if the booking details do not comply with these terms, we may, unfortunately, be forced to cancel the booking before or upon arrival and vacate the unit immediately without any refund, and we will notify the relevant authorities in accordance with the applicable regulations.We appreciate your understanding and cooperation, and we look forward to hosting you and providing you with a comfortable stay.",True,385,False,False,False,,nan
979799389609084264,The Luxury Duplex-Foreigners & Arabs Only Families,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/979799389609084264?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/miso/Hosting-979799389609084264/original/6a4cd685-6576-404b-ad47-9b4ceef5292b.jpeg,29.987,31.397,4.94,65.0,4.88,4.88,4.82,4.58,"2,058","2,058",0,"Welcome to our luxurious and warm duplex! This unique and spacious artistic retreat features four bedrooms, two of which have ensuite bathrooms. Nestled in the heart of New Cairo, one of the most upscale areas—Gharb el Golf – West el Golf Katameya—it offers a prime location with proximity to Katameya Heights, renowned for its golf course, bars, and restaurantsThe spaceThe duplex boasts a distinctive two-floor design and an artistic house façade, adding to its charm. Inside, you'll find a cool and comfortable living room adorned with artistic touches, a bar, and a jacuzzi—a perfect combination for a relaxing evening.To ensure your convenience, If you require transportation, we can arrange a car with a skilled driver to cater to your errands and tours.Not only is our duplex ideal for families, but it also serves as a perfect retreat for friends seeking comfort, simplicity, and luxury. The Cairo airport is just a short 20-minute drive away, and downtown, Zamalek, the Egyptian Museum, and Maadi are all easily accessible within 25 minutes. If you wish to explore the iconic pyramids and Giza area, it's only a 50-minute drive.Indulge in an extraordinary stay at our luxurious duplex, where comfort, style, and convenience come together to create an unforgettable experience.Guest accessThe entire spaceOther things to noteTo make your stay as smooth and enjoyable as possible, we offer a premium airport transfer at a very reasonable cost to pick you up and drop you off conveniently.So you can hit the ground running, we'll also share our favorite local recommendations, from the best places to eat to must-visit spots, and we're always here to help with anything you need. Just ask, and we'll be happy to make your trip truly exceptional :)For extra comfort, we can also arrange daily housekeeping for an additional fee, so you can simply relax and enjoy your stay.To our Egyptian and Arab brothers and sisters:To ensure compliance with the building management's instructions and the local regulations of the Ministry of Interior, mixed-gender stays and visits are permitted only for married couples or first-degree relatives.Therefore, prior to your arrival, please provide us with an official document proving your family relationship or marriage.If the required document is not provided or if the booking details do not comply with these terms, we may, unfortunately, be forced to cancel the booking before or upon arrival and vacate the unit immediately without any refund, and we will notify the relevant authorities in accordance with the applicable regulations.We appreciate your understanding and cooperation, and we look forward to hosting you and providing you with a comfortable stay.",True,429,False,True,False,,nan
