1433131550332600221,Duplex 2 | 4BR Private Pool by Amal Morsi Designs,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1433131550332600221?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-04&check_out=2026-05-09,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTQzMzEzMTU1MDMzMjYwMDIyMQ==/original/dc05f7a5-05df-498c-87bd-b8a8850c586c.jpeg,30.01698,31.49317,5.0,24.0,5.0,5.0,4.92,5.0,"1,158","1,158",0,"Welcome to the pinnacle of elegance. This 4BR, 3BA duplex villa is Amal Morsi’s masterpiece; blending 30 years of design genius into one unforgettable home. Private pool, serene garden, spacious patio, and mirror-glass marble floors elevate every moment. A true mini-mansion, bold and unapologetically grand. It’s not just luxury; it’s legacy. For those who crave more than a stay. Pricey? Yes. But this is where luxury lives, and only the few belong. Please read our house rules before booking.The spaceAs mentioned, this 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom apartment offers exclusive access to the entire space, guaranteeing complete privacy with no shared areas; plus a private pool.(Please note, the pool is NOT heated 🏊‍♂️ ❄️) .> Located by Point 90 Mall, New Cairo.> It's on the Ground Floor.> It features a microwave, smart TV and WiFi. > AC on both cooling & heating modes.> We provide towels, shower gel & shampoo.><><><><><><><><><><><><><><><📍Nearby spots :-> 2 min walk to nearest mosque.> 1 min drive to nearest restaurants.> 1 min drive to nearest restaurants.> 1 min drive to Point 90 Mall.> 3 min drive to Concord Plaza.> 3 min drive to The AUC.> 15 min drive to Cairo Festival City. > 15 min drive to Waterway.> 15 min drive to 5A Mall.> 30 min drive to Zamalek.> 30 min drive to Downtown Cairo.> 30 min drive to Cairo Airport.> 50 min drive to Giza, Pyramids & GEM.",True,230,True,True,False,,nan
