1471160003390200629,Retro Oasis in the heart of Downtown,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1471160003390200629?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1471160003390200629/original/3f6f06b3-1abf-4dca-8bfa-e1329a6bc11c.png,30.0453,31.2378,4.92,26.0,4.96,4.96,4.96,4.88,"1,151","$1,951",-$799.65,"Step into Cairo’s Time Machine!Live like it’s the golden age in the heart of downtown Cairo, where vintage charm meets retro flair. Every corner tells a story. Step outside and you’re in the pulse of the city — walk to cafés, markets, and hidden gems. Snap Insta worthy pics, sip tea on the balcony, and feel the soul of old Cairo… with modern comfort.📍 Location? Unbeatable.🎞️ Vibes? Cinematic.🛏️ Stay? One of a kind.Your retro escape awaits — book now before it’s gone!The space📍 Welcome to Your Retro Egyptian Oasis in the Heart of Downtown Cairo 🇪🇬Step into a world where nostalgia meets comfort, and Cairo’s golden age of charm meets modern-day convenience. This one-of-a-kind, story-filled apartment is located in the very heart of Downtown Cairo, just steps away from iconic squares, buzzing cafés, and historic architecture — all while offering a peaceful escape above the city’s vibrant streets.⸻🛏️ 3 Uniquely Designed Bedrooms – Each Tells a StoryEach of the three spacious bedrooms is a world of its own, carefully curated with handmade furniture, vintage touches, and a retro Egyptian vibe that whispers stories of the past. Expect huge, ultra-comfy beds, high ceilings, and a serene, lived-in charm that blends authenticity with comfort.⸻🍳 Fully Equipped Kitchen + Coffee Lover’s CornerWhether you’re whipping up a quick breakfast or preparing a full dinner, the fully equipped kitchen has everything you need. And if you’re a coffee person, you’re in for a treat — the apartment features a quality coffee machine so you can start your mornings right.⸻📚 2 Massive Library Bookcases for the Curious SoulFor the bookworms, dreamers, and thinkers: this apartment is home to two massive bookcase libraries, stocked with a curated collection of books in multiple languages — from history and art to literature and Cairo’s secrets.⸻🎱 A Dining Table that Turns Into a Pool TableDine, drink, and then play. Our custom dining table transforms into a full-size pool table, turning meals into memories and nights into stories worth telling.⸻🌿 2 Spacious Balconies Overlooking DowntownStep out onto one of the two large balconies for a morning coffee or an evening wine. Gaze out at the energy of Downtown Cairo, watch the city come alive, or just enjoy the breeze with a book in hand.⸻🛁 2 Bathrooms for Your ComfortNo need to wait in line. The apartment features two full bathrooms, clean, functional, and stocked with essentials — designed to keep your stay smooth and stress-free.⸻🛋️ Handmade Furniture & Retro Egyptian DecorEvery corner of the apartment is decorated with handpicked vintage pieces, artisan-made furniture, and décor inspired by 1960s–1980s Cairo — from film posters and textiles to handcrafted lighting and local art. It’s more than just a place to stay — it’s a love letter to old Cairo.⸻🏙️ Central LocationStep outside and you’re immediately immersed in Downtown’s most iconic streets — walk to Tahrir Square, the Egyptian Museum, hidden rooftop cafés, bustling local bakeries, and art deco architecture. You’re minutes away from Metro stations, historic bars, and local street food.⸻✅ Amenities:	•	Fast Wi-Fi	•	Air conditioning in every room	•	Coffee machine	•	Fully equipped kitchen	•	2 large balconies	•	2 full bathrooms	•	Washer	•	Fresh linens & towels	•	Pool table / Dining table combo	•	Massive book library	•	1 king bed / 2 double beds / 1 queen bed  (ideal for families or groups)⸻This apartment isn’t just a stay — it’s a full experience. Whether you’re a traveler, an artist, a reader, or just someone looking for a soulful space in the heart of Cairo, this is your home away from home.📆 Book your stay now and live Cairo like a local — in style, comfort, and stories.Guest accessThe whole apartment is yours !Other things to note- The apartment has 2 full bathroomsOne is extremely big, the other is fairly small.- The apartment has 2 huge balconies- Arabic national couples need marriage certificates",True,647,True,True,False,Downtown Cairo,nan
