49773821,VESTA  - Luxury APT - 2BR - Merghany,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/49773821?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-49773821/original/fe41f3d8-e610-460c-a2da-67aeb7e63be4.jpeg,30.0848,31.3314,4.87,78.0,4.88,4.92,4.76,4.92,468,468,0,"Roof Apartment is located in Heliopolis, Cairo. A very fresh theme in the heart of Masr El Gededa overlooking El Merghany street. Complimentary housekeeping is provided on the 7th day for stays of a full week. Additional housekeeping can be arranged via Airbnb messaging for an extra fee.  Netflix and free Wi-Fi.The spaceApartment Specs: 2BR, 2 Bathrooms, Full Kitchen, Reception, Dinning Room.Amenities:- Wi-Fi (10GB max per day)- Netflix, AC, Private Parking- Pets accepted under request (depends on the breed) Instructions:- For any reservation, a photo for every passport for everyone who will be checking in should be provided at least one day before arrival day so we can provide them entry permits.- For any reservation confirmed same day of arrival, guest will be requested to send a photo for each passport for all the guests who will be checking in before 3 pm Cairo Local time,so, we can provide them entry permits, otherwise guest will not be able to enter the residential compound where this unit is located.- Online Payment is required 7 days before arrival to avoid automated cancellation- Guest will be requested to sign an online registration card upon arrival - Location and Keylock box code will be sent to the guest same day of check-in once payment is confirmed - Check-in from 03.00 PM to 08.00 PM- Check out is at 12.00 PM- No late check out is permitted - No early check in is permitted- Guest will be asked to provide an insurance deposit 300 USD that will be held from his credit card - Unmarried couples and mixed groups are not allowed- Proof of relation may be asked to be provided to us (example: Marriage Certificate) - Visitors are not allowed