1319518528043591439,Esfera Celeste. Unique Luxury Dome w/pyramids view,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1319518528043591439?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1319518528043591439/original/0e17b715-8169-4bbf-946d-ee8f49852a0f.jpeg,29.9856,31.1442,4.82,51.0,4.78,4.55,4.75,4.59,510,510,0,"Experience an unforgettable stay in our luxurious dome, offering breathtaking views of the Pyramids of Giza. Unwind in the hot tub under a starlit sky, and wake up to stunning sunrises over Egypt’s most iconic landmark. Perfect for couples or solo travelers seeking a unique and tranquil escape.       An Intimate Experience in Elegance and SerenityIn Esfera Celeste, we believe that experiences are personal, meaningful, and best-savored in moments of introspection and mindfulness.The spaceEsfera Celeste Dome: An invitation to immerse yourself in the beauty of the present moment.Features & AmenitiesInterior:Step inside a celestial sphere designed to blend elegance and comfort seamlessly. The dome features:	•	A cozy living room with comfortable chairs.	•	A relaxing bedroom.	•	A fully equipped kitchenette, including:	•	Microwave	•	Mini fridge	•	Coffee machine with filter	•	Pots, pans, plates, glasses, cups, and all necessary cooking utensils	•	A modern bathroom with a shower and hot water.	•	A hammock by a large window offering breathtaking views of the pyramids, inviting nature into your space.Exterior:The dome extends into a spacious private terrace facing the pyramids, offering:	•	A private Jacuzzi	•	A stargazing net	•	A lounge area	•	SunbedsAn oasis of serenity, this outdoor space lets you connect deeply with nature.Dimensions:Spanning 45 square meters, the dome offers ample room to relax and unwind.Decor:Beautifully decorated with handmade Egyptian crafts, the dome exudes a sense of authenticity and charm.Air Conditioning:Stay comfortable with air conditioning available in the dome.Wi-Fi:While the serene environment encourages you to disconnect and embrace nature, Wi-Fi is provided for your convenience.Private Desert Terrace:Your terrace opens to the enchanting desert landscape, inviting you to step out and enjoy a peaceful stroll straight from your bed.Private Jacuzzi:Begin your mornings with a refreshing dip in your private Jacuzzi, feeling the soothing embrace of hot or cold water. Greet the sun, breathe in the crisp desert air, and revel in a unique moment of tranquility.Guest accessDownstairs the building we have everything you may need Groceries Supermarket Pharmacy Local good restaurant Local Coffe shoplocal sim card shopOther things to noteTo ensure a smooth and enjoyable experience, please take note of the following:	•	Jacuzzi Heating: To avoid any inconvenience, kindly refer to the instructions provided via the link we share. Keep in mind:	•	In winter, it takes 6 to 7 Hrs to heat.	•	In summer, it takes 4 Hrs to heat.	•	Check-in Process: For a seamless check-in experience, please follow the required instructions carefully.It is always our pleasure to host you and provide a rejuvenating stay at our healing property.",True,425,True,True,False,"""The main view""",nan
1468774485421506345,Capital Grand Princes Suite,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1468774485421506345?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-21&check_out=2026-05-26,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1468774485421506345/original/2c75bfa7-6b31-4369-9af7-8212433fee6f.jpeg,29.984569055176376,31.143665808139485,4.87,30.0,4.93,4.97,4.9,4.53,241,$281,-$39.20,"Welcome to your sleek and modern studio , located in the heart of Giza pyramids  .This beautifully designed space offers the perfect combination of comfort, convenience, and elegance, making it ideal for solo travelers, couples, or business guests.The space✔ Sleeping Area: A cozy queen-size bed with high-quality linens for a restful sleep.✔ Living Area: A stylish lounge with a comfortable sofa, Smart TV, and floor-to-ceiling windows for plenty of natural light.✔ Fully Equipped Kitchen: Featuring a stove, microwave, refrigerator, and coffee machine, perfect for preparing meals.✔ Dining Space: A modern dining table, ideal for meals or remote work.✔ Bathroom: A sleek bathroom with a walk-in shower, fresh towels, and essential toiletries.✔ Balcony: A private outdoor space to unwind and enjoy the peaceful surroundings- Smart TV and high speed WI-FI- Desktop- Air conditioning and supply and exhaust ventilation- Washing machine- Ironing accessories- HairdryerGuest accessIncluded in cost:- Parking spaceGuest accesshat's nearbyGiza Pyramids1.8 kmGreat Sphinx1.9 kmCataract Pyramids Resort4.8 kmThe Andalus Park13 kmCairo Tower13 kmMuseum of Egyptian Modern Arts13 kmQasr el-Nil Bridge13 kmAUC Tahrir Square14 kmFustat Park14 kmCoptic Museum14 kmRestaurants & cafesCafe/BarBeit El Ezz800 mCafe/BarWeekend500 mCafe/BarHalawa500 mTop attractionsTahrir Square14 kmThe Egyptian Museum14 kmAbdeen Palace15 kmAquarium Grotto Garden15 kmIslamic Art Museum15 kmThe Azhar Park18 kmCairo Citadel19 kmPublic transitSubwaySakiat Mekki8 kmSubwayAl-Mounib8 kmTrainGiza Suburbs8 kmTrainEl Giza Train Station8 kmClosest AirportsCairo International Airport30 kmSphinx International Airport32 kmCapital International Airport93 kmOther things to noteGuidelines for Keeping the Unit and Belongings Clean During Your Stay on Airbnb---1. Before Arrival- Make sure all windows and doors are closed after entering, and turn on the ventilation system if available.- Wash your hands immediately upon entering the room, especially before touching furniture or electrical appliances.2. During Your StayA. Caring for Furniture- Avoid placing food or drinks on carpets or sofas.- Only use the designated eating areas (dining table or kitchen).- Do not move the furniture from its place; if you need to adjust it, leave it as it was and inform the host.B. Kitchen- Wash dishes and utensils after each use and place them in the drying rack or dishwasher.- Use paper towels or kitchen trash to dispose of food scraps.- Do not leave food out of the refrigerator to avoid odors and insects.C. Bathroom- Use towels for their intended purpose, whether for drying your face or body, and not for anything else.- Use paper towels neatly and do not throw them in the toilet or sink.- Clean the sink after use.- Close the shower door after bathing to avoid moisture buildup.D. Electrical Appliances- Do not insert any foreign objects into the air conditioner, television, or any electrical device. - Turn off devices you are not using (such as the TV or air conditioner) to save energy. 3. Before Leaving - Arrange the room as you found it: return the furniture to its place, and fold the sheets and towels. - Dispose of trash: place garbage bags in the designated bin and close them tightly. - Inform the host of any damage or missing items (such as broken glass, a malfunctioning air conditioner, etc.). 4. Additional Tips-  Passport or national ID required-  No external visits... Only people staying inside the apartment .-  it's not possible to book accommodations for Arabs without an official marriage contract-  If you notice any unexpected stains or dirt, inform the host immediately. -  Maintain a low noise level, especially at night, to ensure the comfort of your neighbors. -  Guests can book housekeeping services on-demand for a nominal fee. This ensures you can enjoy an        uninterrupted and environmentally sustainable stay. Housekeeping services must be scheduled 24 hours in advance. - If you are a family of more than 4 up to 10 adults, we can arrange multiple rooms on the same floor or    inter-connecting rooms to make you all feel comfortable in the same place but it’s subject to availability and advance notice is required.Thank you for helping to keep the unit clean and for ensuring an enjoyable stay for everyone.If you have any questions, I’m here to help. Hope you enjoy your stay!",True,666,True,False,False,"{""location"": ""The Giza Pyramids"", ""description"": ""Welcome to your sleek and modern studio""}",nan
