1061500549000037414,Historic Boutique Apartment in Downtown Cairo,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1061500549000037414?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/miso/Hosting-1061500549000037414/original/04194edc-70eb-4f9d-9b0f-e44a1be97f94.jpeg,30.04165,31.24171,4.86,144.0,4.83,4.79,4.74,4.77,439,$759,0,"Book an enchanting getaway in this grand two-bedroom gem ornamented with vintage artwork and treasures collected from our world travels. Stay just steps away from Cairo's major museums, monuments, and landmarks while feeling like you are embedded in the culture. Everything in the space was designed specifically for the space and for you to have an artistic experience.Great for groups of friends, couples, or families.The space📍 *Unbeatable Downtown Cairo Location*Stay right in the heart of *Downtown Cairo*, just 5 minutes from the city’s most iconic landmarks. You’ll be a short walk from the world-famous *Egyptian Museum* and *Tahrir Square*, surrounded by historic cafés, local boutiques, vibrant nightlife, and the famous Marouf fashion district.A quick drive 15 minutes takes you to the legendary *Giza Pyramids*, while *Cairo International Airport* is easily accessible for arrivals and departures. Downstairs you’ll find cafés, juice stands, and convenience shops—everything you need within minutes. 🚕🏙️---If you’re visiting Cairo for an unforgettable experience, your stay should feel just as special. This thoughtfully renovated Downtown apartment combines modern comfort with the timeless character of historic Cairo—soaring ceilings, airy rooms, vintage décor, and handcrafted details sourced from local markets. ✨🌿 *What you’ll love:*🛏️ *Two spacious bedrooms* — each with a comfortable queen bed, vanity table, wardrobe with locks for valuables, and powerful air conditioning for Cairo’s warm summers❄️ *Cool & comfortable rooms*Each bedroom features its own air-conditioning unit along with dedicated desks or vanity tables, giving you both comfort and space to prepare for your day. Also there is a heater to insure your comfort in winter ❄️ 👥 *Flexible sleeping space* — the central parlor includes a sofa that converts into a queen bed, and French doors on both sides allow the room to fully close off and become a private third bedroom when needed *Great for groups* — with multiple sleeping arrangements and an additional air mattress available, the apartment can host up to 8 guests comfortably🛋️ *Relaxing living room* — watch TV or unwind while admiring handcrafted details like the custom mosaic artwork and Arabesque coffee table made by local Egyptian artisans🌿 *Charming balcony* — enjoy the sounds of the city from a quaint balcony overlooking a quiet side street, surrounded by tall plants for a touch of privacy🚿 *Modern bathroom*Enjoy bathrooms fitted with *rain shower, bidet, hair dryer, and a washing machine*, giving you hotel-style comfort with the convenience of home.🧺 *In-unit laundry* — washing machine and laundry hamper so you can pack light and refresh your clothes anytime🍳 *Fully equipped kitchen* — includes a gas stove, microwave, refrigerator, freezer, espresso maker, electric kettle, and all the essentials for cooking at home📶 *Strong Wi-Fi* for work or streaming🏺 *Curated décor* — paintings, antiques, and vintage pieces sourced from Cairo’s historic markets give the apartment the feeling of staying inside a living gallery---A unique, spacious, and character-filled stay in the very center of Cairo—perfect for travelers who want to experience the city’s history while enjoying modern comfort. ✨Guest accessYou will have full access to the entire space with all the lovely details, from the living room and bedrooms to the balcony. Feel extra secure in this building, as there is a nice doorman downstairs.Other things to note- The apartment is located up a short flight of stairs on the second floor.- Please note that the heating in some of the room are space heaters. - If you are doing a photoshoot, please message us first as we approve these case by case and for an extra fee",True,581,True,False,False,"""The main view of Cairo's historic cityscape, located in the heart of Downtown Cairo""",nan
1381310134257979009,Floating 3BR Luxury Apartment | Maadi Nile View,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1381310134257979009?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1381310134257979009/original/8fa59fc2-b528-436c-ad42-9f622411976c.jpeg,29.973946748968604,31.234116828961085,5.0,14.0,5.0,4.71,4.86,4.93,592,$819,-$226.53,"Experience one of Maadi’s most breathtaking homes  a luxurious 3-bedroom apartment on the banks of the Nile 🌊✨.From sunrise to sunset, the river surrounds you, offering a 360° panorama of sparkling water, city lights, and serene views 🌅🏙️.The master bedroom opens to sweeping Nile vistas, while three spacious balconies invite you to enjoy your morning coffee ☕ or watch the sun set over Cairo’s skyline 🌇.Every corner is designed for style, and beauty — a true Nilefront masterpiece 🏡🌿.The space🏡 3-Bedroom Nilefront Masterpiece – Heart of Maadi 🌊✨Experience a one-of-a-kind apartment surrounded by the Nile in the heart of Maadi.Master Bedroom 🛏️ – King-size bed with panoramic floor-to-ceiling views of the Nile, creating a breathtaking backdrop from sunrise to sunset 🌅.Second Bedroom 🛏️ – Cozy boho-style décor with a comfortable double bed and Nile views 🌊, perfect for a relaxing retreat.Third Bedroom 🛏️ – Two single beds, ideal for friends, family, or children, combining comfort and style.🍽️ Dining & Living AreaThe open-plan dining area connects to the spacious living room 🛋️, where large windows frame the flowing river, giving you the feeling of floating right on the Nile ✨.The apartment includes 1.5 bathrooms 🚿 and a fully equipped kitchen 🍳, perfect for preparing meals while enjoying the river views.🌿 BalconiesThree private balconies wrap around the apartment, offering panoramic Nile views 🌊 and the perfect spot for morning coffee ☕ or evening sunsets 🌇.This is more than a stay — it’s a true Nilefront experience.Guest accessGuests have full access to the entire apartment 🏡, including:All three bedrooms 🛏️Spacious living & dining area 🛋️🍽️Fully equipped kitchen 🍳1.5 bathrooms 🚿Three private balconies 🌊☕🌇 with stunning Nile viewsAdditional amenities include:Wi-Fi 📶Air conditioning ❄️Smart TV with Netflix & YouTube 📺Washing machine 🧺Everything is set up to ensure a comfortable, relaxing, and memorable Nilefront stay ✨🌿",True,300,True,False,False,,nan
