room: Two small double beds with a beautiful dresser and full sized wardrobe for convenient storage.•	Additional Full Guest Bathroom: For added convenience.•	Advanced Climate Control: Air conditioning units are strategically placed throughout - 2 in the reception, 1 in the master suite, and 1 in the guest bedroom - ensuring perfect comfort in every space.•  Gourmet Kitchen: A fully equipped, high-end kitchen ensures you have everything needed for a seamless stay: washing machine, dishwasher, microwave, hot water kettle, stove, ample silverware, plates, all types of cooking utensils, pans, wine opener, various cups and mugs, fridge containers, serving platters, and much more.•  Prime Sheraton Heliopolis Location: Strategically located for maximum convenience - minutes away from Cairo Airport, City Stars Mall, and leading restaurants, while offering direct routes to New Cairo, Nasr City, and many other areas.",True,356,True,False,False,,nan
