1416740441171469640,Ancient Pyramids View Retreat with Jacuzzi 806,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1416740441171469640?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTQxNjc0MDQ0MTE3MTQ2OTY0MA==/original/94ccddef-3956-44a8-b82d-958c287849be.jpeg,29.9788,31.1468,4.53,32.0,4.66,4.16,4.19,4.47,498,498,0,"✨ Looking for an escape that redefines your travel experience? ✨Wake up to an uninterrupted view of the Great Pyramids of Giza, right from your private studio.The space combines a calm, nature-inspired design with soft ambient lighting, automated curtains, and a warm, intimate atmosphere — ideal for a memorable evening or a peaceful retreat.The spaceImagine watching the sun set between the Pyramids, the sky glowing in shades of gold, while you take it in from the comfort of your private studio. This is where history meets serenity.Each morning begins with a panoramic view of the Great Pyramids, and just steps away, you can explore vibrant streets, authentic culture, and timeless wonders. After a day of discovery, retreat to your thoughtfully designed studio — a space that blends comfort, elegance, and a sense of connection to Egypt’s rich heritage.With a prime location that places you at the heart of Giza, you’ll experience both the rhythm of local life and the awe of one of the world’s most iconic landmarks.This is more than accommodation — it’s offering the perfect balance of modern design and unforgettable atmosphere.Guest access💻 Free High-Speed Wi-Fi – Stay connected with ease📺 Smart TV – Enjoy your favorite shows and movies anytime🔐 Smart Door Locks – Hassle-free and secure self check-in🍳 Fully Equipped Kitchenette – Includes a cooktop, microwave, mini fridge, and silverware – perfect for light cooking🚗 Dedicated Parking – No stress, your spot is always waiting❄️ Air Conditioning – Stay cool and comfortable year-round🏡 Entire Space Just for You – Total privacy, total comfort🌈 Ambient Lighting – Set the mood for a relaxing or romantic evening🪟 Electric Curtains – Open up to breathtaking views with the touch of a buttonOther things to note🌍 A True Egyptian Experience Awaits You!Our neighborhood might surprise you at first glance — some streets are unpaved, and you may see camels, horses, and children playing joyfully in the streets 🐪🐎👦. This is part of the area's charm, offering a raw and authentic experience of daily life in Egypt. Rest assured, it’s a safe, welcoming, and culturally rich place where you can truly immerse yourself in the local way of life.✨ What makes our Airbnb truly special is its unique location in the heart of a local neighborhood — not just near the Pyramids, but woven into the history and rhythm of the land itself.🗺️ Just a short away, you’ll find:🏜️ The Great Pyramids of Giza – one of the Seven Wonders of the Ancient World🏛️ The Grand Egyptian Museum – home to priceless artifacts and pharaohs’ treasures🦁 The Great Sphinx – Egypt’s timeless guardian🏯 The Step Pyramid of Sakkara – a hidden gem steeped in history🛍️ Local Bazaars & Gift Shops – perfect for picking up authentic souvenirs",True,456,True,False,False,'The main view' 'The Great Pyramids of Giza',nan
1148587259262300775,Vintage 2BR Apt in Downtown - Mint 69,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1148587259262300775?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTE0ODU4NzI1OTI2MjMwMDc3NQ==/original/f1ee4f84-903b-41a5-9f20-85c8b8698cec.jpeg,30.0491,31.2434,4.95,120.0,4.95,4.8,4.88,4.93,440,$590,0,"Step into a slice of cinematic history with Mint Stays Egypt – the key to your stay. Our charming apartment, a backdrop for iconic Egyptian films, invites you to relive the golden era. Enjoy breakfast on the terrace, boasting breathtaking views.The master bedroom features late 18th-century furniture, the dining room exudes timeless Art deco  furniture elegance. You'll find original 1950s to 1980s film posters adorning the walls. Discover comfort and nostalgia in every corner.The spaceThe apartment is on the 9th floor with 2 elevators.  45"" LED TV with internet access, HIGH SPEED Wi-Fi, 2 Bedrooms, fully equipped kitchen, 2 private bathrooms.Just steps from Khan el Khalili, Tahrir Square, Moez Street, Abdeen Palace and 15 mins drive to The Great Pyramids, explore Cairo's rich history and vibrant culture. With stores and beloved cafes at your doorstep, indulge in the city's charm. Housed in a historic building once inhabited by movie legends, enjoy 24/7 security and attentive building managers, ensuring peace of mind in the heart of the bustling metropolis.Guest accessPer local regulations, we can only accommodate married couples. A valid marriage certificate must be presented.Other things to notePassports for all guests must be sent before check-in for legal registration, as required by local regulations.",True,203,True,False,False,,nan
