, and vibrant street life — all just steps from the historic Giza Plateau entrance. 🐪🕌Other things to noteYou're staying in one of the most iconic areas in the world — just 950 meters from the Great Pyramids of Giza. While the location is prime for sightseeing, it’s also nestled within a lively local neighborhood full of authentic charm.Expect to experience:🐪 Occasional camel or horse riders passing nearby🎶 Local street sounds or vendors typical of the Giza village atmosphere🕌 Spiritual ambiance with calls to prayer — part of the area’s soul📄 Important notes:Egyptian couples must show a marriage certificate in accordance with local lawIt's a real slice of Egypt with a magical view just outside your window.",True,371,True,True,True,"{""Great Pyramids view"": ""The main view or location feature""}",nan
