stration and local regulations of the Ministry of Interior , mixed stays and visits are permitted only for married couples or first-degree relatives.Therefore, please provide us with an official document proving the relationship of kinship or marriage in advance.In the event that the requested document is not submitted or the reservation details do not comply with these terms, we may have to cancel the reservation before or on arrival and immediately vacate the unit without any refunds, informing the competent authorities in accordance with the approved regulations.We thank you for your understanding and cooperation, and look forward to hosting you and providing you with a comfortable stay.",True,366,False,True,False,French-style staircase leads to the first floor,nan
