1415371678389603532,Taskeen 2 · Nile-View 3 Master Bedrooms · Zamalek,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1415371678389603532?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/miso/Hosting-1415371678389603532/original/d505bb15-a7d7-41b5-ac62-ca07ad46a015.jpeg,30.0654,31.2158,4.91,23.0,4.91,4.87,4.83,4.96,"1,117","$1,371",0,"Taskeen 2🛌 3 Master Bedrooms • 🚿 3.5 Bathrooms • 🌇 19th Floor • 🏞 Nile & Pyramids ViewWelcome to your luxurious home away from home in the heart of Zamalek, Cairo’s most elegant and tranquil island district. Situated on the 19th floor of a prestigious building on Abou El Feda Street, this stunning apartment offers sweeping views of the Nile River, and on a clear day, a breathtaking sight of the Pyramids of Giza right from your window.The space✨ What You'll Love🏞 Panoramic Nile View from the spacious living area🌄 View of the Pyramids when the skies are clear🛏 Three spacious master bedrooms, each with en-suite bathrooms for complete privacy🚽 Additional half bath for guests🛋 Beautifully furnished with stylish decor, cozy lighting, and modern comforts🪟 Floor-to-ceiling windows flooding the space with natural light🧼 Fully-equipped kitchen and in-unit laundry🚪 24/7 security and building conciergeGuest accessNestled in Abou El Feda, one of Zamalek’s most iconic and accessible streets, you’re just steps away from:Riverside cafes and upscale restaurantsArt galleries and cultural centersSupermarkets, pharmacies, and all essentialsA short drive to Downtown Cairo and the Egyptian MuseumOther things to noteThe unit is non-smoking, and no parties are allowed. Government-issued ID or passport required at check-in per local regulations. Married couples only as per Egyptian law for Arab nationals.",True,214,False,False,True,Nile,nan
