38458462,Vivid & Spacious Apartment in Lush Cairo District,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/38458462?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-06&check_out=2026-05-11,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-38458462/original/fdae7dd3-b0ad-4e0f-b90b-ed726d2fc6da.jpeg,29.953787258105763,31.26325551829857,5.0,14.0,5.0,5.0,4.93,4.93,781,781,0,"Bright and airy this apartment sleeps 6 people comfortably with its 3 bedrooms, 2 baths, and 2 balconies. Located in Cairo’s green lounge of Maadi, it lays within a short walking distance of the city's top dining and community spots This characterful and authentically Cairene apartment is decked out in vintage, antique, and handmade furniture and decor. It enjoys open treetop views, and is perched above Cairo's most popular bakery, meaning breakfast & coffee is only an elevator ride away.The spaceGenerously sized with 3 bedrooms, 2 baths, 2 balconies, a full kitchen with a breakfast nook, as well as a spacious reception/living/dining space, this space is big enough to be comfortable for a family or group of friends staying together, but cozy and cocooned enough to be the perfect base for a single traveler or a couple exploring Cairo.The large master bedroom features a king-size bed, plenty of closet space, blackout curtains, and an in-suite bathroom with a walk-in shower, as well as its own balcony. The two other bedrooms are each equipped with a queen or big double bed and their own closet, and one additionally has a workspace (desk and chair).In the bigger bathroom you'll find a charming clawfoot tub, as well as a washer, hidden in a cabinet.The kitchen is not only roomy enough for serious cooking, but also contains a bright breakfast nook with a beautiful treetop view, while the combined living/dining space has plenty of relaxed seating around the coffee table, a proper dining table that seats 6, and a stunning bookshelf made from an antique arch. The smaller balcony with a cafe-type table and 3 dining chairs is accessed from this space.",True,278,False,False,False,Nile view,nan
1138076289355351323,"NEW Luxurious apartment in Sodic EastTown
NewCairo",https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1138076289355351323?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-13&check_out=2026-05-18,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1138076289355351323/original/088e48cb-eadf-4fa5-8216-89c4f765e260.jpeg,30.0105,31.5157,5.0,26.0,5.0,4.96,4.96,4.96,"1,124","1,124",0,"Unwind&enjoy the serene, stylish ambiance of this stunning new apartment in New Cairo's prestigious Sodic East Town compound, one of Egypt's most renowned communities. Conveniently located across from the club, you'll have easy access to amenities including a gorgeous swimming pool.The compound also features a new mall EDNC that has supermarket, cafes, shops,delivery services & dry clean.The Westin Cairo Golf Resort & Spa is located right across the street,where you can spend the day golfing/spaThe spaceBook your stay in this brand-new, spacious, and beautiful three-bedroom apartment in Easttown. We eagerly await the opportunity to welcome you to your home away from home.Relax in the stylish comfort of this beautiful new apartment, nestled in New Cairo’s prestigious Sodic Eastown compound, one of Egypt’s most sought-after communities. Ideally located just across from the club, you’ll enjoy quick access to premium amenities including a scenic swimming pool, on-site restaurant, ATM, and hair salon/barber. The compound also offers a supermarket, convenient food delivery, and reliable cleaning and ironing services.A newly opened mall, EDNC, is just a 10-minute walk from the apartment, featuring a variety of shops, cafes, and services to make your stay even more enjoyable. Just steps outside the compound, indulge in a day of luxury at The Westin Cairo Golf Resort & Spa, perfect for golfing or unwinding at the spa.For your security and peace of mind, the flat is equipped with cameras outside the main door, in the garden, and in the hallway inside the apartment (this indoor camera is switched off). We always ask our guests if they’re comfortable with the outdoor cameras being active during their stay. If you’d prefer them to be covered, we’re happy to do so upon request.Thank you for your understanding.Guest accessGuests have full access to the entire apartment. Enjoy complimentary passes to the club, swimming pool. Free parking is also available.Guests also have access to the new mall (EDNC) from inside the compound.Other things to noteThis apartment wasn’t designed for rental—it was created as a personal space with carefully selected, high-end finishes and attention to every detail. It offers more than just a place to stay, it’s a true holiday experience. Enjoy complimentary access to a stunning swimming pool and make the most of the premium amenities available throughout your stay.For bookings longer than one month, a monthly discount is available. Please note that in such cases, electricity charges will be billed separately.",True,399,False,True,False,Nile,nan
1413793482058721505,Taskeen 1 · 3 Bedrooms overlooking the Nile – Zamalek,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1413793482058721505?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/miso/Hosting-1413793482058721505/original/7ceca00c-4096-4fab-9cd1-f0b089ba9110.jpeg,30.0703,31.2193,5.0,15.0,4.93,5.0,4.93,5.0,"1,122","1,122",0,"(Taskeen 1) Wake up to breathtaking views of the Nile from this stylish, fully-furnished apartment located in one of Cairo’s most vibrant and upscale  eighborhoods — Zamalek. Situated on Abou El Feda Street, you’ll be steps away from top restaurants, cafés, and cultural attractions, while enjoying a peaceful retreat above the city.The spaceThis modern, airy apartment offers:🛋️ Bright living area with large windows and direct Nile views🛏️ Cozy bedroom with premium linens🍽️ Fully equipped kitchen for all your cooking needs🚿 Modern bathroom with high-end fixtures🧼 Washer, air conditioning, and high-speed Wi-FiEvery detail is designed for comfort — whether you're working remotely, exploring Cairo, or just relaxing by the window with the Nile as your backdrop.Guest accessYou’ll have the apartment all to yourself, including:Self check-inElevator accessSecurity in the buildingOther things to note📜 House Rules – Please Read Before BookingTo ensure your safety, comfort, and full compliance with **Egyptian Law & Regulations**, we kindly ask all guests to review and adhere to the following rules: 🔐 Check-In Requirements* All guests must provide **valid ID or passport copies** upon arrival to complete the check-in process.* A **rental agreement** must be signed upon check-in.* **Unregistered guests** are not permitted. If you expect a visitor, they must be registered in advance.#### 🚫 **No Parties or Events*** This apartment is part of a peaceful residential building. **Parties, loud gatherings, and events are strictly prohibited** to respect neighbors.#### 🧹 **Housekeeping*** Housekeeping is available **upon request** between **10:00 AM – 3:00 PM**.* For any special cleaning needs or assistance, please don’t hesitate to contact us.#### 💼 **Damage & Missing Items*** Any **missing or damaged items** (e.g., towels, keys, utensils, furniture) will be charged and added to your bill before check-out.---### 👥 **Additional Notes for Arab Nationals & Arabic Passport Holders*** Couples are required to present a **valid marriage certificate**, **GCC family card**, or any **official proof of marriage**.* **Unofficial documents**, including ""Orfi"" contracts, **are not accepted** as per Egyptian Law.---Kindly note: **These rules are mandatory**, and we appreciate your cooperation in ensuring a smooth and respectful stay for everyone.We look forward to hosting you and wish you a wonderful stay by the Nile 🌊",True,356,True,False,False,Nile,nan
1454518561688224646,"Zen stays, The Lux Nest 3BR Lakeview residence",https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1454518561688224646?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1454518561688224646/original/db9cb1bf-bdfd-4d27-9287-e857174e75cd.jpeg,30.02584,31.53706,5.0,15.0,5.0,4.93,4.93,5.0,"1,085","1,085",0,"Luxury 3BR Apartment in Lake View Residence, Cairo Fully furnished & equipped, this elegant 3BR apartment features a master bedroom (king bed) and two bedrooms (2 single beds each). Enjoy modern finishes, a fully equipped kitchen, spacious living area, and stunning lake views. Located in a secure, upscale community with premium amenities. Perfect for families or professionals!  Ready to move in!🏡✨The space1 Master bedroom with an ensuite, 2 Bedrooms with 2 Single beds and a shared bathroom. Living & Dining Area, with luxury furnishings, and a brand new modern kitchen. Amazing scenery with a large terrace, and an outdoor lounge area.",True,101,False,False,False,lake view,nan
1496950722323360486,Artistic Natural Retreat | Hot Tub & Pyramids,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1496950722323360486?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-06-06&check_out=2026-06-11,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTQ5Njk1MDcyMjMyMzM2MDQ4Ng==/original/03ebd5f8-0851-49ff-bbd6-0488428ccb90.jpeg,29.9768,31.142,4.88,26.0,4.81,4.77,4.85,5.0,406,406,0,"Sleep surrounded by storybook stone walls and soft desert light 🌿This soulfully designed space features handcrafted arches, natural textures, and a sculptural hot tub by the window, where you can soak as sunlight through the trees and the Pyramid tip peeks into view ✨Enjoy artistic handmade decor, and a warm, cave-like ambiance that reconnects you with nature and yourself.Head to the rooftop to share coffee with the Great Pyramids. A place made with love, and timeless charm. 🌄☕🧘‍♂️The spaceStep into a serene space crafted with warmth, story, and artistic soul 🌿✨. Every element in this retreat is inspired by the raw beauty of Egypt and the quiet power of the Great Pyramids, just 950 meters away.Inside you’ll find:🛁 A sculptural freestanding bathtub beside a panoramic window with Pyramid glimpse🛏️ King-size bed with a custom leaf-carved headboard tucked into a stone arch🪵 Handcrafted textures, earthy finishes, and soulful artisan details throughout❄️ Air conditioning for comfort in every season📺 Smart TV and Wi-Fi for cozy nights🚿 Private bathroom with walk-in shower and fresh towels🍽️ Kitchenette with:SinkMini fridgeElectric cooktopKettleOpen wooden shelving and local ceramic touchesThis is more than just a place to stay — it’s a space to reconnect, dream, and soak in the magic of ancient lands from your very own natural retreat. 🕌🕊️✨Guest accessYou’ll have full private access to your studio — your own peaceful sanctuary with a built-in jacuzzi and iconic views of the Great Pyramids, just 950 meters away. 🛁🕌🌇 You’re also welcome to enjoy the shared rooftop, where we serve a complimentary breakfast daily ☕🍉 with panoramic views of the pyramids — perfect for sunrise moments and sunset magic.☀️ In summer, you can also enjoy the rooftop swimming pool, a refreshing spot to cool down under the Egyptian sun. 🏊‍♀️🌴🛍️ Just outside the building, you’ll find local cafés, street vendors, small shops, and easy walking access to the Giza Plateau gate, all adding to the area’s authentic charm. 🐪🕌Other things to noteYou're staying in one of the most iconic areas in the world — just 950 meters from the Great Pyramids of Giza. While the location is prime for sightseeing, it’s also nestled within a lively local neighborhood full of authentic charm.Expect to experience:🐪 Occasional camel or horse riders passing nearby🎶 Local street sounds or vendors typical of the Giza village atmosphere🕌 Spiritual ambiance with calls to prayer — part of the area’s soul📄 Important notes:Egyptian couples must show a marriage certificate in accordance with local lawIt's a real slice of Egypt with a magical view just outside your window.",True,422,True,True,False,The main view or location feature,nan
