ou at Bayt YakanGuest accessThe residents of Bayt Yakan have free access to the the open courtyard, the historic halls and in-house library space, the roof terrace and its adjoining kitchen and laundry facilities. Mind you, occasionally the above mentioned halls are not available due to private events and scheduled photo shoots.",True,335,False,False,False,"""Main view""",nan
