and housekeeping services Prime LocationSituated in the heart of Cairo at Nile Plaza, the residence offers seamless access to the city’s finest dining, cultural landmarks, business districts, and nightlife — all while enjoying the privacy of a luxury serviced residence.Whether you’re visiting Cairo for business, leisure, or a special occasion, this residence offers an exceptional stay with the comfort of home and the services of a five-star hotel.Guest accessGuests will have complimentary  access to the gym and pool and paid access to all Four Seasons amenities and services, including house keeping, room service, spa services, laundry services, on-call doctor, transportation, dining at any of the Four Seasons' outlets/restaurants: The Bar (where most of Egypt’s rich, famous and expats hangout for cocktails, and doing business), Eight (Asian fusion), Bella (Italian restaurant), Graffiti (night club), Zitouni (open 24/7). Guests also have access to the lobby lounge, which is happening all day and night, as well as to Beyman's cafe. Beyman is also accessible for those who want access to a decent variety of top fashion brand shopping. Concierge services are available from 6:00 am to midnight, and guest services are available 24/7.Other things to notePrivate Concierge & VIP ServicesAvailable Upon Request | Additional Fees ApplyFor guests seeking an elevated experience, we offer a curated selection of private concierge and VIP services, subject to availability and advance arrangement:VIP airport meet and greet at the airport only.Private airport and city transportation.Private tour guides and bespoke excursions.Private chef experience.Dining, nightlife, and entertainment recommendations.Shopping and lifestyle experiences.Please contact us via Airbnb messaging to arrange any of these services.",False,479,True,True,False,"\nThe main view or location feature (e.g., pyramids view, Nile view , city center, balcony with view)\nor any other view you find.",nan
