rom your balcony or living room🌍 Prime Location Highlights:Steps from Tahrir Square & Egyptian Museum 🏛️Surrounded by luxury hotels: Ritz-Carlton, St. Regis, Four Seasons 🏨Close to Zamalek, Garden City & the Pyramids 🚗Easy access to metro and business districts 🏢Overlooks iconic Cairo landmarks: Mamsha Ahl Masr Promenade, famous Nile boats like Le Pacha 1901 & The Imperial 🚤🔐 Secure & quiet building with two elevators and rooftop privacyPerfect for families, groups, business travelers, or luxury seekers looking for a unique Nile-view experience in Cairo. Whether for a short stay or extended visit, this apartment offers comfort, elegance, and an unmatched location.🗝️ Book now to experience luxury rooftop living with iconic Nile views in the heart of Cairo!Guest accessYou will have the whole space to yourself nothing is being shared nothing is off limits.Other things to note🚗 All Kind of transportation are available also you can download london Cap or Uber app to order a car to your door! always available and cheap.🏜️🐫 Attractions to Visit:📍 Egyptian Museum – Just a 5 -minute walk, showcasing ancient artifacts and treasures.📍 Tahrir Square – The heart of Cairo's history and culture.📍 The apatment overlooking Mamsha Ahl Masr – A scenic promenade along the Nile, perfect for evening strolls.📍 Cairo Opera House – Experience world-class performances and cultural events.📍 Khan El Khalili Bazaar – A vibrant marketplace for souvenirs, spices, and handcrafted treasures.🌟 Book your stay today and experience Cairo in style! 🌟Secure your dates now and make unforgettable memories in one of Cairo’s most sought-after locations!",True,501,False,False,False,"""Nile View""",nan
