eal for families & groups✔️ Exceptional views you won’t find elsewhere✔️ Spacious, comfortable & elegant✔️ Perfect for tourists, photographers & first-time Cairo visitorsGuest accessAll rooms and spaces in the property.Other things to notePlease note that we can only receive mixed groups if all individuals are married or first-degree relatives, in line with local laws. Therefore, we require official documents such as marriage or birth certificates to prove the relationship. These conditions also apply to visitors.This condition applies to all Arab nationalities, including: Saudi Arabia, Kuwait, UAE, Bahrain, Jordan, Syria, Lebanon, Palestine, Iraq, Libya, and Egypt.",True,340,False,False,True,,nan
