944289552529814347,Homey Room Downtown,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/944289552529814347?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6OTQ0Mjg5NTUyNTI5ODE0MzQ3/original/05797e50-30ed-4273-87a6-2f35783eeba6.jpeg,30.03453,31.24063,4.97,36.0,4.94,4.92,4.92,4.83,99,$110,0,"A beautiful old flat! We're on the 12th floor overlooking Cairo. The flat is spacious and clean, with a large kitchen, living room, and plants. It's a great location - 15min walk to Tahrir and downtown areas in one direction, near to Hussein/Khan al-Khalili in the other. Next to the Saad Zaghloul metro station, & easy bus/microbus access. Please let us know a little about yourself if you are interested - thank you!The spaceOur flat has two bedrooms that share a bathroom, one master bedroom with its own bathroom, a nice living room with a small balcony, and a large kitchen. This bedroom shares a bathroom in the hallway with one other person. The large windows in this apartment offer great views and air, and they make the place feel very open!During your stayYour hosts are an American guy teaching history and an Egyptian guy working as an accountant. We're very laid back and we'll be around, but we have our own spaces, too. 😊 Depending on the date, there may be one other Airbnb guest in their own, separate bedroom. But don't worry, we screen our guests carefully.Other things to noteWe have a cat named Shadow 😺",True,198,False,False,False,Cairo,nan
