29854607,Private Room w/ Balcony | Downtown Cairo | Museum,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/29854607?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-29854607/original/719da613-7920-464a-a3ac-d6f179eedb75.jpeg,30.04771,31.24209,4.77,141.0,4.79,4.8,4.74,4.83,108,$123,0,"Stay at Golden Star Hotel in Downtown Cairo! 🏨 You’ll be just steps from the Egyptian Museum, Nile , and metro . Your room offers a comfy bed 🛏️, private bathroom 🚿, balcony with street view , AC ❄️, and free Wi-Fi 📶 . With 24/7 front desk support 🛎️, fresh linens, and friendly staff ready to help, you’ll have everything you need to explore Cairo, enjoy local food 🍲, and feel at home while discovering the city’s culture and history ✨.The spaceWhen you stay at Golden Star Hotel 🏨, you’ll be in the heart of Downtown Cairo, close to all the city’s highlights. Walk to the Egyptian Museum, the Nile River, and Mohamed Nageeb Metro . Whether you’re here for history, food, or nightlife, you’ll find it right outside your door.🛏️ YOUR ROOM🌿Comfortable 15–20 m² private room🌿Balcony with street view 🌿Private bathroom 🚿 with fresh towels and linens🌿Air conditioning ❄️ and TV screen🌿Free Wi-Fi 📶 to stay connected🌿Daily cleaning service🛎️SERVICES YOU'LL ENJOY 🌿24/7 front desk support – we’re always here for you🌿Secure entry for peace of mind🌿Shared kitchen access 🍳 to save on meals🌿Friendly, professional staff ready to help📍 SURROUNDINGS & ATTRACTIONS🌿150m → Mohamed Nageeb Metro 🌿1 km → Egyptian Museum & Nile 🌿2.5 km → Cairo Tower 🌿3 km → Khan El Khalili Bazaar & Al Azhar Park 🌿6 km → Salah El Din Citadel 🏰🌿24 km → Pyramids of Giza 🌿30 km → Cairo International Airport ✈️You’re also near cafés, local restaurants, nightlife, and the bus station for trips to Sharm El Sheikh, Dahab, Hurghada, and Marsa Alam.🌟 MY EXPERIENCE AS A HOSTWith over 7 years of hosting experience and a Superhost badge, you can trust us to make your stay smooth, safe, and memorable. We’ll share with you the best local food, hidden gems, and cultural highlights, so your Cairo trip is more than a visit — it’s an experience.🏡 DURING YOUR STAYOur 24/7 front desk team will look after you throughout your stay.I want your stay to feel easy, comfortable, and stress-free. As a Superhost with 230+ reviews, I do my best to make sure every detail is taken care of.🌿 I respond quickly to questions and love helping guests discover the best of Cairo.🌿 Need early check-in or late checkout? Message me and I’ll do my best to arrange it.🌿 Looking for local cafés, restaurants, or attractions?  Ask me and I’ll share my personal favorites.🌿Not sure if this room is the right fit for your trip? Send me a quick message — I’ll be glad to help you decide. Your comfort and peace of mind come first. I look forward to welcoming you and making your stay memorable.Guest accessFeel free to use the dining area and kitchen anytime during your stay.Other things to note🚭 Smoking is not allowed inside the rooms, but you are welcome to smoke on the balcony.🥐 Breakfast is available from 8:30 am to 11 am at a cost of $2 USD per person.📑 As per local regulations, Arab and Egyptian couples are kindly required to present a valid marriage certificate at check-in.🚫 Please note: Guests from Cairo, Giza, and Qalyubia cannot be accommodated.",True,523,True,False,False,,nan
1378469979839176479,The Lavish Sunshine,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1378469979839176479?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-02&check_out=2026-05-07,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-U3RheVN1cHBseUxpc3Rpbmc6MTM3ODQ2OTk3OTgzOTE3NjQ3OQ==/original/4d9ef13c-2bae-4f2f-8751-d46b2a41cc86.jpeg,30.0584,31.2226,4.84,31.0,4.77,4.81,4.61,4.9,564,564,0,"Welcome to your serene getaway nestled on Mahmoud Azmy Street in the heart of Zamalek. This exquisite, newly decorated two-bedroom apartment by Red Door Design House boasts a unique and spacious layout that perfectly blends modern elegance with comfort.The spaceUpon entering, you will be greeted by an inviting living room and a cozy TV area, ideal for relaxation and entertainment. The chic dining room offers an elegant space for enjoying meals, complimented by a fully equipped kitchen, ready for all your culinary adventures.Each bedroom is thoughtfully curated, featuring premium bedding to ensure a restful night's sleep. Natural sunlight floods every corner of the apartment, creating a warm and cheerful atmosphere throughout.Despite being in the vibrant neighborhood of Zamalek, the apartment is situated in a quiet location, just a two-minute walk from the tranquil Nile. Here, you can enjoy the best of both worlds—peaceful surroundings with the lively energy of the area close by.Indulge in the unique shower design and tasteful decor that make this apartment a standout choice for all types of travelers seeking style and an ideal location. Whether you're here for business or pleasure, this apartment promises a tasteful stay filled with comfort and convenience. Your ultimate getaway awaits!Guest accessThe entire apartmentOther things to noteArrive with ease and start enjoying your stay right away! Our premium airport transfer service is available at a reasonable price, and we will share our top local recommendations with you. We’re always here for you💫For Egyptians and Arab siblings:In order to comply with the instructions of the building administration and local regulations of the Ministry of Interior , mixed stays and visits are permitted only for married couples or first-degree relatives.Therefore, please provide us with an official document proving the relationship of kinship or marriage in advance.In the event that the requested document is not submitted or the reservation details do not comply with these terms, we may have to cancel the reservation before or on arrival and immediately vacate the unit without any refunds, informing the competent authorities in accordance with the approved regulations.We thank you for your understanding and cooperation, and look forward to hosting you and providing you with a comfortable stay.",True,362,False,False,False,Nile,nan
