1537829300662642384,"Azure 201 Studio | Pool, Garden & Roof - New Cairo",https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1537829300662642384?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-12&check_out=2026-05-17,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1537829300662642384/original/e13455b0-06bf-437c-af82-e4d4002ca53a.jpeg,30.0534,31.4193,5.0,25.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,4.88,182,182,0,"Villa-Style Studio!Experience comfort and value at Azure Studios in New Cairo — your private studio with access to a large pool, spacious garden, and sunny rooftop terrace.Each unit features a private bathroom, kitchenette, smart TV, Wi-Fi, and air conditioning. Located inside a compound with 24-hour security, and on-site staff available anytime, you’ll enjoy the luxury of a villa for the price of a studio.The spaceWelcome to Azure Apartments, your modern home-away-from-home in the heart of New Cairo.Our property offers the comfort and privacy of a villa combined with the convenience and value of individual apartments.The villa is thoughtfully divided into several private apartment units, each designed for comfort, style, and functionality. Guests enjoy their own private space while sharing access to beautiful outdoor areas and premium amenities.Guest accessGuests have exclusive access to their own private apartment, as well as access to these shared areas within the property:Swimming pool – Relax or take a refreshing dipGarden area – Enjoy quiet moments surrounded by greeneryRooftop terrace – Perfect for morning coffee, sunsets, or social timePlease note:Only registered guests are allowed inside the apartments.Visitors are welcome only in the garden and rooftop terrace areas.Smoking is allowed on the balcony, garden, and rooftop terrace, but not inside the apartment itself.",True,206,True,True,False,,nan
