1234099258874611632,Green View Room • Cozy Stay in the Heart of Cairo,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1234099258874611632?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1234099258874611632/original/b2298f04-84e3-44a2-94b9-074171234e57.jpeg,30.0356,31.2308,4.95,39.0,4.9,4.74,4.92,4.97,170,170,0,"Stay in a bright private room inside a shared, fully renovated apartment in Garden City—Cairo’s most elegant, tree-lined district—just behind the Four Seasons Nile Plaza. The home’s star feature is the large balcony with rare green views over two landscaped gardens plus a peek of the Nile Corniche only a 1–2 minute walk away—perfect for morning coffee or an evening wind-down. Your room is calm and comfortable, with A/C, fast Wi-Fi, a work desk, wardrobe, blackout curtains and green view.The spaceThis private room features a new, comfortable Queen size bed, a large wardrobe, a desk for work or study, a cozy chair with a pouf, and a plush carpet for added comfort. Enjoy the beautiful view of the Indonesian Embassy’s garden and surroundings from your window. The room is tastefully decorated and includes a full-length mirror and plenty of storage space, making it ideal for both short and extended stays.Shared Spaces & Amenities:The apartment includes a large reception area with a cozy living room and a dining area. There’s a fully-equipped, spacious kitchen with all essentials: a gas stove, refrigerator, microwave, kettle, mixer, and washing machine. Hot water is always available with two water heaters (one in the kitchen and one in the bathroom). You’ll also have access to two bathrooms—a large main bathroom next to your room and an additional guest bathroom near the reception area.Guest accessYou’ll share the apartment with the host and have access to the spacious living area, equipped kitchen, and the balcony. 2 shared bathrooms are kept spotless. The building is secure and elegant, with a welcoming lobby and on-site garage access.During your stayI will be always available on phone,social media platforms and mails.Other things to noteWelcome to a spacious and cozy apartment in the heart of Cairo’s Garden City, one of the city’s most desirable neighborhoods! This fully renovated, spacious home offers a true blend of modern comfort and prime location, ideal for travelers wanting a tranquil retreat within steps of the Nile and downtown Cairo.🌟 Prime Location in Garden City – Explore Cairo with Ease! 🌟Our apartment is nestled in the heart of Garden City, one of Cairo’s most charming and secure neighborhoods. Not only will you enjoy the peaceful green views and central location, but you’ll also be just minutes away from Cairo’s most famous attractions:🏛️ Cultural & Historical Landmarks:The Egyptian Museum (10 min) – Home to the treasures of Tutankhamun and ancient Egypt.Tahrir Square (7 min) – Cairo’s vibrant central hub.Abdeen Palace (12 min) – A stunning royal palace and museum.Coptic Cairo (15–20 min) – Visit the Hanging Church, Synagogue of Ben Ezra, and St. Sergius Church.Islamic Cairo (15–20 min) – Discover Al-Muizz Street, Sultan Hassan Mosque, and Al-Rifa’i Mosque.Cairo Opera House (10 min) – Enjoy concerts, ballet, and cultural performances.🎨 Museums & Art:Museum of Islamic Art (12 min) – One of the greatest in the world.National Museum of Egyptian Civilization (NMEC) (15 min) – Where the royal mummies are displayed.The Coptic Museum (15 min) – Showcasing Egypt’s Christian heritage.Mohamed Mahmoud Khalil Museum (15 min) – Fine art collections in a beautiful villa.🌳 Relax & Stroll:Corniche El-Nil (2 min walk) – Perfect for morning walks along the Nile.Al-Azhar Park (20 min) – A green oasis with stunning views of historic Cairo.Zamalek Island (10 min) – Trendy cafés, art galleries, and boutiques.🛍️ Shopping & Dining:Khan El Khalili Bazaar (20 min) – Traditional market with souvenirs, spices, and crafts.Downtown Cairo (5–10 min) – Lively streets with shops, restaurants, and cafés.Zamalek Dining Scene (10 min) – Upscale restaurants and bars by the Nile.✨ With so many attractions nearby, our apartment is the perfect base for exploring Cairo’s culture, history, and vibrant lifestyle.☕ Cool Cafés & Dining    Eish + Malh (Downtown): Cozy brunch spot with great coffee.    Felfela (Classic Egyptian food since the '50s).    Sequoia or Crimson (Zamalek): Trendy Nile-view dining experiences.You’ll be in the heart of downtown Cairo, close to major attractions, restaurants, and shops, with easy access to transportation. The building itself is secure and elegant, featuring a beautiful entrance garden, a spacious lobby, and a garage for parking.Whether you’re here for work or leisure, this room offers a quiet, comfortable retreat with all the conveniences you need. Book your stay with us and experience the best of Cairo from a prime Garden City location!",True,712,True,False,False,,nan
955852733507615918,"VESTA Oriana Villas – 4BR, Cairo Festival City",https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/955852733507615918?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/prohost-api/Hosting-955852733507615918/original/b70cd9ce-bae3-46c6-a0c8-c7dd0407a42a.jpeg,30.0348,31.4122,4.64,22.0,4.77,4.68,4.45,4.82,"2,198","2,198",0,"Oriana Villa is located in Cairo Festival City, Cairo. A very fresh theme in the heart of New Cairo. Complimentary housekeeping is provided on the 7th day for stays of a full week. Additional housekeeping can be arranged via Airbnb messaging for an extra fee. Netflix and free Wi-Fi.The spaceApartment Specs: 4BR, 3 Bathrooms, Full Kitchen, Reception, Dining Room, Nany Room.Amenities:- Wi-Fi (20GB max per day)- Netflix, AC, Private Parking- Pets accepted under request (depends on the breed) Instructions:- For any reservation, a photo for every passport for everyone who will be checking in should be provided at least one day before arrival day so we can provide them entry permits.- For any reservation confirmed same day of arrival, guest will be requested to send a photo for each passport for all the guests who will be checking in before 3 pm Cairo Local time,so, we can provide them entry permits, otherwise guest will not be able to enter the residential compound where this unit is located.- Online Payment is required 7 days before arrival to avoid automated cancellation- Guest will be requested to sign an online registration card upon arrival - Location and Keylock box code will be sent to the guest same day of check-in once payment is confirmed - Check-in from 03.00 PM to 08.00 PM- Check out is at 12.00 PM- No late check out is permitted - No early check in is permitted- Guest will be asked to provide an insurance deposit 300 USD that will be held from his credit card - Unmarried couples and mixed groups are not allowed- Proof of relation may be asked to be provided to us (example: Marriage Certificate) - Visitors are not allowed- Guest may be requested to provide a photo for a Valid Residence Visa or Valid Visit Residence to Egypt",True,304,True,False,False,"{'location': 'Cairo Festival City', 'amenities': ['Wi-Fi (20GB max per day)', 'Netflix', 'AC'], 'features': None, 'keylockboxcode': None}",nan
