1607609360722380702,Smart Tiny Home Studio – Boho Vibes in Zamalek,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1607609360722380702?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1607609360722380702/original/f0551cb2-deb8-4784-8dd2-c8f8fa45e6fe.jpeg,30.0659,31.22,5.0,2.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,5.0,186,$237,0,"The Luxury Tiny Home Experience 🏠✨Experience smart, minimalist living in this chic Boho-style studio. Perfect for couples or solo travelers, this cleverly designed space features a royal bed with a unique mirrored ceiling, a cozy living area with a huge Smart TV, and a fully equipped kitchenette. Enjoy high-end finishes, warm lighting, and a private, quiet atmosphere. Small in size, but big on luxury and comfort! Your perfect, stylish city retreat awaits.perfect for solo and couplesThe spaceWelcome to your cozy sanctuary! If you’re a fan of the global ""Tiny Living"" trend, this studio was designed just for you. We’ve embraced the concept of ""Smart Spaces"" to offer a retreat that combines a compact footprint with full-scale luxury. Here, every detail has a purpose, and every corner has its own charm.Why You’ll Love This Space: * Smart Layout: Though it's a ""Tiny Home,"" it features a royal sleeping area, a Bohemian living corner, a fully equipped kitchenette, and a flexible dining spot. * Spacious Feel: The unique mirrored ceiling above the bed and the strategic lighting design create an airy, open atmosphere that defies its compact size. * Top-Tier Entertainment: A huge Smart TV (Netflix/YouTube ready) for a premium cinematic experience right from your bed or sofa. * Fully Equipped Kitchenette: Includes a JAC microwave, electric kettle, stovetop, and a complete set of stylish cookware and glassware. * Boho-Chic Decor: Handcrafted Macramé wall art, natural wicker lighting, and warm wooden flooring for a truly ""homey"" feel.Perfect ForSolo travelers or couples looking for a minimalist, stylish, and private stay in a prime locationGuest accessHelloWe're ready to confirm your booking nowI just wanted to confirm the places details again in English before confirmation 1. The space is — 22 sqm — it’s a small studio.2. The place has no windows or balconies (it’s internal), but there is a strong ventilation system that can be used when needed to refresh the air in the room.3. The building where the studio is located is a bit old (stairs and hallway are old), but the location is central and right next to many restaurants and shops.4. Once the booking is confirmed, we will need a photo of your passport.5. The maximum occupancy is 2 people. No parties or loud noise are allowed.6. The air conditioner must not be left running while you are out of the apartment, to save energy and protect the equipment.Overall, the place is modest and small in size.If you have any questions or concerns, please share them with us.Thank you.Other things to notemportant Note on Lighting & Ventilation: The studio features a quiet, inward-facing design with no direct windows to the street. Instead, it has a dedicated ventilation window that opens onto the internal corridor. While it does not receive direct sunlight, the space remains fresh and comfortable thanks to an effective internal ventilation system and a powerful hot/cold air conditioning unit for year-round climate control.",True,484,False,False,False,city center,nan
