1362065411862874941,Arabia studio @sunlit rustic horizon home,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1362065411862874941?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-06-22&check_out=2026-06-27,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1359508477735296867/original/7e5f4bee-0e1c-42f3-86f0-2cb0c7bad97d.jpeg,30.0493507099461,31.23533170262072,4.97,32.0,4.84,4.91,4.91,4.88,178,178,0,"Nestled in the heart of Downtown Cairo, this stylish studio  blends rustic charm with modern comfort. Featuring natural wood accents, woven textures, and warm lighting, it offers a cozy yet elegant atmosphere. Enjoy stunning minaret views and a peaceful escape just steps from the Egyptian museum,the famous koshary Abu Tarek, and the metro station  and other cairo’s landmarks. Perfect for travelers seeking an authentic yet serene stay in the heart of Cairo.The spaceWelcome to my cozy central studio with a skyline ooen view  located in the heart of downtown cairo .. enjoy the superfast wifi connection .. all ammenties you may need for a comfortable stay in your home away from home.Your space: Studio:Experience the best of open view  in this inviting studio, where a plush queen-sized bed  covered in egyptian cotton linens and duvet, and cozy seating area blend seamlessly into one welcoming space. Large windows flood the room with natural light and reveal a unique cityscape view, including a beautiful historic mosque just outside. The warm wooden floors, neutral palette, and subtle bohemian touches create a relaxing ambiance. Unwind on the comfortable armchairs while enjoying your favorite shows on the flat-screen TV, or rest in the serene sleeping area after a day of exploring. Perfect for solo travelers or couples, this thoughtfully designed studio offers a calming haven right in the heart of the city.Full kitchen:  This kitchen is private for the studio but you can access it from a shared corridor with another condo in the same house where you can enjoy cooking at home in this compact yet well-appointed kitchen, featuring white cabinetry, stylish teal accents, and modern appliances—including a stovetop, oven, and microwave. With ample storage full of all kitchenware and all hot drinks you should try , a sleek countertop, and essential cookware provided, you can whip up anything from a quick breakfast to a cozy dinner. Bright and functional, it’s perfect for guests looking to feel right at home while exploring the city.Bathroom:This bathroom is private for you but you can access it from a shared corridor with another condo in the same apartment, this bathroom isdesigned with comfort and convenience in mind. Featuring a sleek pedestal sink, a spacious private shower area, and modern fixtures, it offers everything you need from towels, showergel.. etc. for a refreshing experience. The unique blend of teal walls and white subway tiles adds a contemporary touch, while thoughtful details like a large mirror and ambient lighting create a relaxing atmosphere. Perfect for freshening up after a day exploring downtown Cairo.Laundry room:Make the most of your stay with this shared  dedicated laundry area, featuring a front-loading washing machine and overhead cabinets for all your supplies. Perfect for longer visits or simply freshening up after a day of exploring, it adds a practical touch to your home-away-from-home experience.Guest accessThis studio is fully private with shared only  laundry room with another condo inside the same house .. you have your private full kitchen and private  full bathroomOther things to note1- There is a mosque right in front of the building, clearly visible in the photos. The call to prayer can be heard five times a day, which is a normal part of daily life  in Egypt and adds to the authentic local atmosphere.2- The apartment is no 15 on the 4th floor .. don't forget to close the elevator’s inside doors after getting in or out so it will not move until they are closed. Your private bathroom and private kitchen are in the corridor in front of the studio.",True,591,True,False,False,Stunning minaret views,nan
1384838980381903311,Stylish 2-Bedroom Apartment | Silver Palm,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1384838980381903311?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-02&check_out=2026-05-07,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-1384838980381903311/original/4a1fb196-2d44-489e-929a-c670436d69bb.jpeg,30.048,31.4764,5.0,16.0,4.88,4.75,4.81,4.81,545,545,0,"Experience high-end living in this luxury 2-bedroom apartment at Silver Palm Compound, the heart of New Cairo. Featuring modern design, premium finishes, and elegant hotel-style furniture for ultimate comfort. Enjoy a spacious living area, fully equipped kitchen, and two sleek bathrooms. Perfectly located near top restaurants, cafés, and shopping hubs, with the famous O1 Mall inside the compound offering all lifestyle and leisure facilities.The spaceKITCHENA luxurious kitchen finished with premium materials, fully equipped with all essential appliances and utensils. It includes an oven, full-sized refrigerator, microwave, kettle, dishwasher, and washing machine, combining practicality and elegance for a seamless cooking experience.⸻LIVING AREAA spacious and inviting living area, perfect for relaxation or entertaining guests.The room features a large, comfortable sofa and a 75-inch Smart TV, creating the ideal space for unwinding in style.⸻BEDROOMSThe apartment features two master bedrooms, each with a king-size bed (180 x 200 cm) and a private en-suite bathroom. Both rooms include built-in wardrobes and are designed for ultimate comfort and restful sleep.⸻BATHROOMSEach master bedroom includes its own modern bathroom with a walk-in shower, complemented by an additional guest bathroom. All bathrooms are stocked with plush towels, shampoo, and soap for your convenience.⸻ADDITIONAL AMENITIESThe apartment includes central air conditioning, free Netflix for movies and series, free TOD to stream live matches worldwide, high-speed Wi-Fi, a washer, and an ironing board with a steam iron.Guest accessAs a guest, you’ll enjoy full access to the compound’s premium facilities, designed for comfort, leisure, and convenience.The building features a shared swimming pool (open during summer) and free underground parking.Just a one-minute walk away lies O1 Mall, one of New Cairo’s most vibrant destinations, offering:A wide variety of restaurants and cafés, a central courtyard adorned with water features, trees, and flowers, a children’s play area, and a fully equipped gym (available for an additional fee of approximately USD 12 per person, valid for single use).You’ll also find a medical center, pharmacy, bank, post office, currency exchange, secure parking, and free Wi-Fi throughout the area.⸻Nearby AttractionsO1 Mall: 1 minuteGarden 8 Mall: 10 minutesDistrict 5 Mall: 15 minutesCairo Festival City Mall (CFC): 15 minutes5A Mall: 20 minutesCairo International Airport: 20 minutesDowntown Cairo: 45 minutesGrand Egyptian Museum: 45 minutesOther things to noteOnce you have booked and received the confirmation email, to ensure a smooth check in we kindly ask you to provide your passport details.Your passport will only serve the following purpose:- notify the building security to allow apartment access.The cleaning fees mentioned in the price breakdown cover only the check out cleaning. For any additional in-stay cleaning, please reach out to us for prices and bookings.Additional ServicesAn extra folding bed can be provided upon request; however, it is not the same as the main bed and may offer less comfort.A baby crib, a child’s long chair, and additional towels can also be arranged.All of these items must be requested in advance at least 5 days before arrival to ensure availability.Please note that additional charges apply for these services.",True,492,True,True,False,Pyramid View,nan
