1335056471617196547,Mid-Century Vibes. Modern Convenience. CasaMayouie,https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1335056471617196547?locale=en-US&currency=USD&check_in=2026-05-01&check_out=2026-05-06,https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/miso/Hosting-1335056471617196547/original/e01061ea-1a1c-4b01-8f6a-7ec8096772f2.jpeg,30.04,31.2161,5.0,30.0,4.97,4.97,4.97,4.9,557,557,0,"Welcome to Casa Mayouie, a stylish mid-century modern apartment in Cairo’s lively Dokki neighborhood, just 4 blocks from the Nile and close to Zamalek and Downtown.Perfect for families, couples, or remote workers, it features a fully equipped kitchen, fast Wi-Fi, and a cozy living area.Complimentary airport pick-up and next-door laundry service (washing, drying, ironing) are available for longer stays. Self-check-in with a smart lock allows you to arrive anytime and enjoy total flexibility.The spaceBedrooms & Bathrooms: - Master bedroom with a king-size bed, ample closet space, and a private ensuite bathroom with sleek Grohe shower fixtures.- Guest bedroom with two double beds, dual closets, and a functional workspace.- Bathrooms stocked with locally-made, sulfate-free shampoo, conditioner, and shower gel from Bubblzz.Living Area:- Open and inviting with a comfortable L-shaped sofa and a 55” Smart TV loaded with streaming apps.- Bright spaces enhanced by layered lighting and vibrant plants throughout for a cozy atmosphere.Kitchen:- Open-concept kitchen with a centerpiece island bar that seats four.- Equipped with premium Berghoff induction cookware, a Bosch electric oven, an induction stovetop, and a built-in microwave.- Stocked with all essentials, including spices, oils, utensils, and various glassware.- Coffee corner with a Nespresso machine and pods, Moka pot, French press, and a Smeg kettle.- My personal cast-iron skillet is available upon request.Workspace:- Dedicated desks in each bedroom with USB and Type-C outlets for easy charging and productivity.Guest accessGuests have full access to the apartment, located on the ground floor for easy entry and exit. However, due to steps at the entrance, it is not wheelchair accessible.Other things to noteNeighborhood Highlights:Located 4 blocks from the Nile, Casa Mayouie is situated in Dokki, a vibrant neighborhood just across the bridge from Zamalek. The area is ideal for those looking to explore Cairo’s dynamic culture and food scene:- Local gems like a bakery, spice shop, and juice bar are steps away.- The city’s top koshary joints are right around the corner.- Enjoy Nile views from nearby rooftop bars.- A pharmacy is conveniently located right in front of the building, with multiple hospitals just around the corner.- A metro stop is within walking distance, and Tahrir Square, the Egyptian Museum, and downtown are a short 5-minute Uber ride or a pleasant walk.- Groceries and meals can be delivered directly to your door.",True,380,True,False,False,,nan
