unge beds and a cozy café/bar for your favorite drink or snack.	•	A fully equipped fitness center with cardio and strength areas, flooded with daylight.	•	Professional spa services and a dedicated massage room for deep relaxation.	•	Modern sauna for a soothing wellness escape.	•	Stylish co-working space for your business needs.	•	Safe kids’ play area for family convenience.	•	Secure underground parking with reserved spaces.	•	24/7 security and professional concierge — all backed by JW Marriott’s renowned hospitality.Airport: 20 minO1 Mall: 1 minWaterway Mall: 5 minDistrict 5 Mall: 15 minGarden 8 Mall: 10 minCFC Mall: 15 min5A Mall: 20 minDowntown Cairo: 45 minGrand Egyptian Museum: 45 minGiza Pyramids: 55 minOther things to noteOnce you have booked and received the confirmation email, to ensure a smooth check in we kindly ask you to provide your passport details.Your passport will only serve the following purpose:- notify the building security to allow apartment access.The cleaning fees mentioned in the price breakdown cover only the check out cleaning. For any additional in-stay cleaning, please reach out to us for prices and bookings.Additional ServicesAn extra folding bed can be provided upon request; however, it is not the same as the main bed and may offer less comfort.A baby crib, a child’s long chair, and additional towels can also be arranged.All of these items must be requested in advance at least 5 days before arrival to ensure availability.Please note that additional charges apply for these services.",True,486,True,True,False,balcony,nan
